window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/courses/b174-51654f4d164af600.json"]={sha256:"51654f4d164af600d9e949fee66c0a36d2e77181ffbb416356049bf3a9ac9336",value:{"id":"b174","title":"水平定向鑽掘導向","titleEn":"Horizontal directional drilling guidance","category":"underground","kind":"course","status":"guided","contentStatus":"reviewable-educational-curriculum","summary":"本課以定向鑽掘的姿態積分、誤差來源與障礙淨距為主線，從鑽桿長度與垂向投影與方位誤差與橫向漂移建立系統邊界，再把磁場干擾與方位可信度、設施淨距與不確定度連到竣工閉合與全線可信度。導向幾何與磁場算例為小偏差或單段簡化，並非鑽進路徑指令；定位不確定度、管徑及設施尺寸需另併入。 十單元以可核算的模型和可追溯證據逐步判讀不同失效。","summaryEn":"This course focuses on directional-drilling attitude integration, error sources and obstacle clearance. It begins with Rod length and vertical projection and Heading error and lateral drift, links Magnetic interference and heading confidence and Utility clearance and uncertainty, and ends with As-built closure and route confidence. Guidance geometry and magnetic examples simplify small errors or single segments and are not drilling commands; positioning uncertainty, pipe diameter and utility dimensions require separate inclusion. Ten units use reproducible models and traceable evidence to distinguish failure mechanisms.","scope":"依公開工程原理、官方資料與規範架構編寫的原創教學；步驟是可驗證的學習任務與假想算例，不是設計圖說、施工計畫、開挖、注漿或受限空間作業許可，也不是任何專案的設計文件。數值均為教學假設或公開資料，實際工程須由合格技師依規範與實測資料重新計算並簽證。","scopeEn":"Original teaching built from public engineering principles, official sources and code frameworks. Steps are verifiable learning tasks and hypothetical exercises, not design drawings, method statements, excavation, grouting or confined-space permits, or any project's design documents. Numbers are teaching assumptions or public data; real work must be recalculated and certified by qualified engineers using codes and measured data.","subcategory":"ug-trenchless","subcategoryTitle":"無開挖、豎井與岩洞","subcategoryTitleEn":"Trenchless works, shafts and caverns","learningTrack":"underground","learningSubdiscipline":"ug-trenchless","learningTags":["underground","ug-trenchless","pipe"],"architectureFamily":"pipe","architectureNodes":[["鑽桿長度與垂向投影","Rod length and vertical projection"],["曲率半徑與角度單位","Curvature radius and angular units"],["磁場干擾與方位可信度","Magnetic interference and heading confidence"],["設施淨距與不確定度","Utility clearance and uncertainty"],["竣工閉合與全線可信度","As-built closure and route confidence"]],"architectureEdges":[[0,1],[1,2],[2,3],[3,4],[0,3]],"diagram":{"type":"pipe","labels":["鑽桿長度與垂向投影","曲率半徑與角度單位","磁場干擾與方位可信度","設施淨距與不確定度","竣工閉合與全線可信度"],"labelsEn":["Rod length and vertical projection","Curvature radius and angular units","Magnetic interference and heading confidence","Utility clearance and uncertainty","As-built closure and route confidence"],"original":true,"notToScale":true},"workedExample":{"title":"原創假想算例與邊界","titleEn":"Original hypothetical example and boundaries","text":"整合算例所有輸入均為教學假設。首先檢查鑽桿長度與垂向投影：verticalChange=L*sin(inclination)=3 m*sin(5 degrees)=0.2615 m；再獨立檢查方位誤差與橫向漂移：lateralOffset=100 m*tan(0.1 degrees)=0.1745 m。方向誤差由 0.1 增至 0.2 度，在 100 m 直段上橫向差約由 0.175 增至 0.349 m；系統誤差不能靠增加相同來源讀值消除。 兩個結果不能自動組成完整設計，因為導向幾何與磁場算例為小偏差或單段簡化，並非鑽進路徑指令；定位不確定度、管徑及設施尺寸需另併入。 將對照進返流量、環空壓力及地表異常位置作為模型以外的驗證證據，並保留原始紀錄與尚待確認的邊界。","textEn":"All inputs in this integrated example are teaching assumptions. First check Rod length and vertical projection: verticalChange=L*sin(inclination)=3 m*sin(5 degrees)=0.2615 m. Independently check Heading error and lateral drift: lateralOffset=100 m*tan(0.1 degrees)=0.1745 m. Increasing heading error from 0.1 to 0.2 degree raises lateral offset over a 100 m straight segment from about 0.175 to 0.349 m; repeating the same biased source does not remove systematic error. The two results are not a complete design because guidance geometry and magnetic examples simplify small errors or single segments and are not drilling commands; positioning uncertainty, pipe diameter and utility dimensions require separate inclusion. Use compare feed and return flow, annular pressure and locations of surface anomalies as evidence independent of the calculation, retaining raw records and unverified boundaries.","assumptions":"數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表任何專案的設計值、量測值或規範允許值；改變系統邊界或荷載組合後必須重算。","assumptionsEn":"Inputs are teaching assumptions, not any project's design values, measurements or code allowances; recalculate after changing the system boundary or load combination.","sourceScope":"原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與工程背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。","sourceScopeEn":"Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and project context, not these numbers."},"depth":5,"languageCoverage":["zh-TW","en"],"simulationOnly":true,"educationEdition":14,"enrichmentVersion":14,"stages":[{"id":"b174-v14-s1","title":"地層條件、邊界與工程系統","titleEn":"Ground conditions, boundaries and engineering system","description":"本階段聚焦「鑽桿長度與垂向投影」與「方位誤差與橫向漂移」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Rod length and vertical projection\" and \"Heading error and lateral drift\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b174-v14-01","title":"鑽桿長度與垂向投影：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Rod length and vertical projection: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"],"prerequisiteIds":[],"objective":"說明「鑽桿長度與垂向投影」如何影響水平定向鑽掘導向的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Rod length and vertical projection” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Horizontal directional drilling guidance”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"鑽進長度沿實際路徑量取，垂向變化由傾角投影決定而非直接等於桿長。分段積分需保留角度正負與參考方向，彎曲段還需考慮角度在桿內的變化；一個末端傾角不能代表整段平均姿態。 判別這個機制時，應觀察核對桿長紀錄、傾角符號與獨立高程閉合；若出現把向下傾角符號反用，路徑深度隨進尺愈算愈錯，便須重新檢查原先假設的接觸、力或水的傳遞邊界，而不能只調整計算結果。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「鑽桿長度與垂向投影」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Drilled length follows the actual path, while vertical change comes from inclination projection rather than rod length itself. Segment integration requires signed angles and reference direction, with curvature changing attitude within a rod. One endpoint inclination cannot automatically represent the segment-average attitude. Use the following check to discriminate the mechanism: Check rod-length records, inclination signs and independent elevation closure. If reversing the sign of downward inclination progressively corrupts calculated depth, revisit the assumed contact, force or water-transfer boundary rather than merely adjusting the calculated result. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Rod length and vertical projection” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設：verticalChange=L*sin(inclination)=3 m*sin(5 degrees)=0.2615 m。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions: verticalChange=L*sin(inclination)=3 m*sin(5 degrees)=0.2615 m.","failure":"常見誤解：「鑽桿末端傾角一定等於整根鑽桿的平均傾角」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"The rod-end inclination always equals the mean inclination of the whole rod\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「鑽桿長度與垂向投影」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Rod length and vertical projection”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b174-v14-01-k1","title":"鑽桿長度與垂向投影","titleEn":"Rod length and vertical projection","text":"鑽進長度沿實際路徑量取，垂向變化由傾角投影決定而非直接等於桿長。分段積分需保留角度正負與參考方向，彎曲段還需考慮角度在桿內的變化；一個末端傾角不能代表整段平均姿態。","textEn":"Drilled length follows the actual path, while vertical change comes from inclination projection rather than rod length itself. Segment integration requires signed angles and reference direction, with curvature changing attitude within a rod.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]},{"id":"b174-v14-01-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：鑽桿末端傾角一定等於整根鑽桿的平均傾角 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: The rod-end inclination always equals the mean inclination of the whole rod Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「鑽桿長度與垂向投影」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Rod length and vertical projection\" is correct?","options":["鑽桿末端傾角一定等於整根鑽桿的平均傾角","鑽進長度沿實際路徑量取，垂向變化由傾角投影決定而非直接等於桿長。","同一導向儀讀很多次就能消除所有系統性方位偏差"],"optionsEn":["The rod-end inclination always equals the mean inclination of the whole rod","Drilled length follows the actual path, while vertical change comes from inclination projection rather than rod length itself.","Many readings from one guidance instrument eliminate every systematic heading bias"],"answer":1,"explanation":"鑽進長度沿實際路徑量取，垂向變化由傾角投影決定而非直接等於桿長。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Drilled length follows the actual path, while vertical change comes from inclination projection rather than rod length itself. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":1},{"id":"b174-v14-02","title":"鑽桿長度與垂向投影：定量估算","titleEn":"Rod length and vertical projection: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"],"prerequisiteIds":["b174-v14-01"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「鑽桿長度與垂向投影」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Rod length and vertical projection” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設：verticalChange=L*sin(inclination)=3 m*sin(5 degrees)=0.2615 m。導向幾何與磁場算例為小偏差或單段簡化，並非鑽進路徑指令；定位不確定度、管徑及設施尺寸需另併入。 此結果僅用來核對量綱及模型敏感度，不是專案設計值、實測紀錄或現場允收門檻。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions: verticalChange=L*sin(inclination)=3 m*sin(5 degrees)=0.2615 m. Guidance geometry and magnetic examples simplify small errors or single segments and are not drilling commands; positioning uncertainty, pipe diameter and utility dimensions require separate inclusion. This checks dimensions and model sensitivity; it is neither measured project data nor a design or acceptance value. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：核對桿長紀錄、傾角符號與獨立高程閉合。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Check rod-length records, inclination signs and independent elevation closure.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b174-v14-02-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設：verticalChange=L*sin(inclination)=3 m*sin(5 degrees)=0.2615 m。導向幾何與磁場算例為小偏差或單段簡化，並非鑽進路徑指令；定位不確定度、管徑及設施尺寸需另併入。 此結果僅用來核對量綱及模型敏感度，不是專案設計值、實測紀錄或現場允收門檻。","textEn":"Original teaching assumptions: verticalChange=L*sin(inclination)=3 m*sin(5 degrees)=0.2615 m. Guidance geometry and magnetic examples simplify small errors or single segments and are not drilling commands; positioning uncertainty, pipe diameter and utility dimensions require separate inclusion. This checks dimensions and model sensitivity; it is neither measured project data nor a design or acceptance value.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]},{"id":"b174-v14-02-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「鑽桿長度與垂向投影」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Rod length and vertical projection\", which statement holds?","options":["工具面偏轉角度永遠等於成孔路徑的實際轉向角","陀螺不受磁場影響就代表永遠不會產生方位誤差","原創教學假設：verticalChange=L*sin(inclination)=3 m*sin(5 degrees)=0.2615 m。"],"optionsEn":["Toolface deflection always equals the actual turning angle of the bore","A gyro immune to magnetic interference never develops heading error","Original teaching assumptions: verticalChange=L*sin(inclination)=3 m*sin(5 degrees)=0.2615 m."],"answer":2,"explanation":"原創教學假設：verticalChange=L*sin(inclination)=3 m*sin(5 degrees)=0.2615 m。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching assumptions: verticalChange=L*sin(inclination)=3 m*sin(5 degrees)=0.2615 m. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":2},{"id":"b174-v14-03","title":"鑽桿長度與垂向投影：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Rod length and vertical projection: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"],"prerequisiteIds":["b174-v14-02"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「鑽桿長度與垂向投影」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Rod length and vertical projection” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"核對桿長紀錄、傾角符號與獨立高程閉合。量測須保存位置、時間及基準，讓同條件的重複結果可比較；並特別檢查「把向下傾角符號反用，路徑深度隨進尺愈算愈錯」是否能由這組資料區分。儀器校核與誤差估計應先於判讀，由負責技師核定該項試驗的允收和停留點。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Check rod-length records, inclination signs and independent elevation closure. Retain position, time and datums for comparable repeats, specifically distinguishing this scenario: Reversing the sign of downward inclination progressively corrupts calculated depth. Instrument checks and uncertainty estimates precede interpretation; the responsible engineer sets acceptance and hold points for this test. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：將核對桿長紀錄、傾角符號與獨立高程閉合列為該構件的交接證據，連結到施工位置、材料批次及判讀版本。若發現把向下傾角符號反用，路徑深度隨進尺愈算愈錯，先保留原始紀錄並由負責技師確認處置，不能以本課算例替代核定作業計畫。","observationEn":"Site practice: Apply the following check at handover: Check rod-length records, inclination signs and independent elevation closure. Link results to location, material batch and interpretation version. If reversing the sign of downward inclination progressively corrupts calculated depth, retain original records and obtain the responsible engineer's disposition; this example does not replace an approved work plan.","failure":"注意干擾：把向下傾角符號反用，路徑深度隨進尺愈算愈錯。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Reversing the sign of downward inclination progressively corrupts calculated depth. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b174-v14-03-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"核對桿長紀錄、傾角符號與獨立高程閉合。量測須保存位置、時間及基準，讓同條件的重複結果可比較；並特別檢查「把向下傾角符號反用，路徑深度隨進尺愈算愈錯」是否能由這組資料區分。儀器校核與誤差估計應先於判讀，由負責技師核定該項試驗的允收和停留點。","textEn":"Check rod-length records, inclination signs and independent elevation closure. Retain position, time and datums for comparable repeats, specifically distinguishing this scenario: Reversing the sign of downward inclination progressively corrupts calculated depth. Instrument checks and uncertainty estimates precede interpretation; the responsible engineer sets acceptance and hold points for this test.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]},{"id":"b174-v14-03-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"將核對桿長紀錄、傾角符號與獨立高程閉合列為該構件的交接證據，連結到施工位置、材料批次及判讀版本。若發現把向下傾角符號反用，路徑深度隨進尺愈算愈錯，先保留原始紀錄並由負責技師確認處置，不能以本課算例替代核定作業計畫。","textEn":"Apply the following check at handover: Check rod-length records, inclination signs and independent elevation closure. Link results to location, material batch and interpretation version. If reversing the sign of downward inclination progressively corrupts calculated depth, retain original records and obtain the responsible engineer's disposition; this example does not replace an approved work plan.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「鑽桿長度與垂向投影」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Rod length and vertical projection\"?","options":["核對桿長紀錄、傾角符號與獨立高程閉合。","量測時不必記錄溫度、水頭、開挖序列與施工荷重，因為它們不會影響結果。","平均環空流速正常就能排除所有冒漿風險"],"optionsEn":["Check rod-length records, inclination signs and independent elevation closure.","Temperature, water head, excavation sequence and construction loads need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","Normal mean annular velocity rules out every inadvertent-return risk"],"answer":0,"explanation":"核對桿長紀錄、傾角符號與獨立高程閉合。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Check rod-length records, inclination signs and independent elevation closure. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":3},{"id":"b174-v14-04","title":"鑽桿長度與垂向投影：失效診斷","titleEn":"Rod length and vertical projection: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"],"prerequisiteIds":["b174-v14-03"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「鑽桿長度與垂向投影」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Rod length and vertical projection” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"把向下傾角符號反用，路徑深度隨進尺愈算愈錯。相似表徵也可能由量測偏差造成，因此應回到核對桿長紀錄、傾角符號與獨立高程閉合，以獨立證據判別原因；只修補可見症狀將留下原本的傳力或滲流問題。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Reversing the sign of downward inclination progressively corrupts calculated depth. Similar symptoms can arise from measurement bias: return to check rod-length records, inclination signs and independent elevation closure to discriminate the cause. Treating visible symptoms alone leaves the original transfer or seepage problem unresolved. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：判別這個機制時，應觀察核對桿長紀錄、傾角符號與獨立高程閉合；若出現把向下傾角符號反用，路徑深度隨進尺愈算愈錯，便須重新檢查原先假設的接觸、力或水的傳遞邊界，而不能只調整計算結果。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: If reversing the sign of downward inclination progressively corrupts calculated depth, revisit the assumed contact, force or water-transfer boundary rather than merely adjusting the calculated result.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「鑽桿末端傾角一定等於整根鑽桿的平均傾角」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"The rod-end inclination always equals the mean inclination of the whole rod\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b174-v14-04-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"把向下傾角符號反用，路徑深度隨進尺愈算愈錯。相似表徵也可能由量測偏差造成，因此應回到核對桿長紀錄、傾角符號與獨立高程閉合，以獨立證據判別原因；只修補可見症狀將留下原本的傳力或滲流問題。","textEn":"Reversing the sign of downward inclination progressively corrupts calculated depth. Similar symptoms can arise from measurement bias: return to check rod-length records, inclination signs and independent elevation closure to discriminate the cause. Treating visible symptoms alone leaves the original transfer or seepage problem unresolved.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]},{"id":"b174-v14-04-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「鑽桿長度與垂向投影」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Rod length and vertical projection\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。","把向下傾角符號反用，路徑深度隨進尺愈算愈錯。","同一導向儀讀很多次就能消除所有系統性方位偏差"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is a workmanship error, so design and detailing never need review.","Reversing the sign of downward inclination progressively corrupts calculated depth.","Many readings from one guidance instrument eliminate every systematic heading bias"],"answer":1,"explanation":"把向下傾角符號反用，路徑深度隨進尺愈算愈錯。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Reversing the sign of downward inclination progressively corrupts calculated depth. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":4},{"id":"b174-v14-05","title":"方位誤差與橫向漂移：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Heading error and lateral drift: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"],"prerequisiteIds":["b174-v14-04"],"objective":"說明「方位誤差與橫向漂移」如何影響水平定向鑽掘導向的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Heading error and lateral drift” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Horizontal directional drilling guidance”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"微小方位偏差沿距離累積成顯著橫向漂移，固定偏差與隨機噪聲的統計行為不同。直線投影可估單一偏差的量級，真正路線需要逐段姿態積分；不能把多次讀值平均當成對磁北或控制網的獨立校核。 判別這個機制時，應觀察比較重複方位讀值與獨立測量控制的方向差；若出現固定方位偏差被當隨機誤差平均，長距離後仍偏離走廊，便須重新檢查原先假設的接觸、力或水的傳遞邊界，而不能只調整計算結果。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「方位誤差與橫向漂移」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Small heading bias accumulates into substantial lateral drift, unlike zero-mean random noise. Straight projection estimates one fixed-bias effect, while real routes require segmentwise attitude integration. Averaging repeated readings does not independently verify the magnetic reference or survey control network. Use the following check to discriminate the mechanism: Compare repeated headings with independently surveyed control directions. If a fixed heading bias is treated as random noise and the long route still leaves its corridor, revisit the assumed contact, force or water-transfer boundary rather than merely adjusting the calculated result. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Heading error and lateral drift” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設：lateralOffset=100 m*tan(0.1 degrees)=0.1745 m。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions: lateralOffset=100 m*tan(0.1 degrees)=0.1745 m.","failure":"常見誤解：「同一導向儀讀很多次就能消除所有系統性方位偏差」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Many readings from one guidance instrument eliminate every systematic heading bias\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「方位誤差與橫向漂移」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Heading error and lateral drift”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b174-v14-05-k1","title":"方位誤差與橫向漂移","titleEn":"Heading error and lateral drift","text":"微小方位偏差沿距離累積成顯著橫向漂移，固定偏差與隨機噪聲的統計行為不同。直線投影可估單一偏差的量級，真正路線需要逐段姿態積分；不能把多次讀值平均當成對磁北或控制網的獨立校核。","textEn":"Small heading bias accumulates into substantial lateral drift, unlike zero-mean random noise. Straight projection estimates one fixed-bias effect, while real routes require segmentwise attitude integration.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]},{"id":"b174-v14-05-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：同一導向儀讀很多次就能消除所有系統性方位偏差 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Many readings from one guidance instrument eliminate every systematic heading bias Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「方位誤差與橫向漂移」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Heading error and lateral drift\" is correct?","options":["同一導向儀讀很多次就能消除所有系統性方位偏差","用弧長除角度時不需要區分度數與弧度","微小方位偏差沿距離累積成顯著橫向漂移，固定偏差與隨機噪聲的統計行為不同。"],"optionsEn":["Many readings from one guidance instrument eliminate every systematic heading bias","Dividing arc length by angle never requires distinguishing degrees from radians","Small heading bias accumulates into substantial lateral drift, unlike zero-mean random noise."],"answer":2,"explanation":"微小方位偏差沿距離累積成顯著橫向漂移，固定偏差與隨機噪聲的統計行為不同。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Small heading bias accumulates into substantial lateral drift, unlike zero-mean random noise. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":5},{"id":"b174-v14-06","title":"方位誤差與橫向漂移：定量估算","titleEn":"Heading error and lateral drift: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"],"prerequisiteIds":["b174-v14-05"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「方位誤差與橫向漂移」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Heading error and lateral drift” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設：lateralOffset=100 m*tan(0.1 degrees)=0.1745 m。導向幾何與磁場算例為小偏差或單段簡化，並非鑽進路徑指令；定位不確定度、管徑及設施尺寸需另併入。 此結果僅用來核對量綱及模型敏感度，不是專案設計值、實測紀錄或現場允收門檻。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions: lateralOffset=100 m*tan(0.1 degrees)=0.1745 m. Guidance geometry and magnetic examples simplify small errors or single segments and are not drilling commands; positioning uncertainty, pipe diameter and utility dimensions require separate inclusion. This checks dimensions and model sensitivity; it is neither measured project data nor a design or acceptance value. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：比較重複方位讀值與獨立測量控制的方向差。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Compare repeated headings with independently surveyed control directions.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b174-v14-06-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設：lateralOffset=100 m*tan(0.1 degrees)=0.1745 m。導向幾何與磁場算例為小偏差或單段簡化，並非鑽進路徑指令；定位不確定度、管徑及設施尺寸需另併入。 此結果僅用來核對量綱及模型敏感度，不是專案設計值、實測紀錄或現場允收門檻。","textEn":"Original teaching assumptions: lateralOffset=100 m*tan(0.1 degrees)=0.1745 m. Guidance geometry and magnetic examples simplify small errors or single segments and are not drilling commands; positioning uncertainty, pipe diameter and utility dimensions require separate inclusion. This checks dimensions and model sensitivity; it is neither measured project data nor a design or acceptance value.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]},{"id":"b174-v14-06-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「方位誤差與橫向漂移」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Heading error and lateral drift\", which statement holds?","options":["原創教學假設：lateralOffset=100 m*tan(0.1 degrees)=0.1745 m。","總磁場強度正常就能保證磁導向的方位完全準確","圖上的中心距大於零就代表鑽孔與設施一定不接觸"],"optionsEn":["Original teaching assumptions: lateralOffset=100 m*tan(0.1 degrees)=0.1745 m.","Normal total magnetic intensity guarantees completely accurate magnetic heading","Positive centerline separation on a map guarantees bore and utility do not touch"],"answer":0,"explanation":"原創教學假設：lateralOffset=100 m*tan(0.1 degrees)=0.1745 m。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching assumptions: lateralOffset=100 m*tan(0.1 degrees)=0.1745 m. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":6},{"id":"b174-v14-07","title":"方位誤差與橫向漂移：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Heading error and lateral drift: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"],"prerequisiteIds":["b174-v14-06"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「方位誤差與橫向漂移」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Heading error and lateral drift” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"比較重複方位讀值與獨立測量控制的方向差。量測須保存位置、時間及基準，讓同條件的重複結果可比較；並特別檢查「固定方位偏差被當隨機誤差平均，長距離後仍偏離走廊」是否能由這組資料區分。儀器校核與誤差估計應先於判讀，由負責技師核定該項試驗的允收和停留點。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Compare repeated headings with independently surveyed control directions. Retain position, time and datums for comparable repeats, specifically distinguishing this scenario: A fixed heading bias is treated as random noise and the long route still leaves its corridor. Instrument checks and uncertainty estimates precede interpretation; the responsible engineer sets acceptance and hold points for this test. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：將比較重複方位讀值與獨立測量控制的方向差列為該構件的交接證據，連結到施工位置、材料批次及判讀版本。若發現固定方位偏差被當隨機誤差平均，長距離後仍偏離走廊，先保留原始紀錄並由負責技師確認處置，不能以本課算例替代核定作業計畫。","observationEn":"Site practice: Apply the following check at handover: Compare repeated headings with independently surveyed control directions. Link results to location, material batch and interpretation version. If a fixed heading bias is treated as random noise and the long route still leaves its corridor, retain original records and obtain the responsible engineer's disposition; this example does not replace an approved work plan.","failure":"注意干擾：固定方位偏差被當隨機誤差平均，長距離後仍偏離走廊。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: A fixed heading bias is treated as random noise and the long route still leaves its corridor. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b174-v14-07-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"比較重複方位讀值與獨立測量控制的方向差。量測須保存位置、時間及基準，讓同條件的重複結果可比較；並特別檢查「固定方位偏差被當隨機誤差平均，長距離後仍偏離走廊」是否能由這組資料區分。儀器校核與誤差估計應先於判讀，由負責技師核定該項試驗的允收和停留點。","textEn":"Compare repeated headings with independently surveyed control directions. Retain position, time and datums for comparable repeats, specifically distinguishing this scenario: A fixed heading bias is treated as random noise and the long route still leaves its corridor. Instrument checks and uncertainty estimates precede interpretation; the responsible engineer sets acceptance and hold points for this test.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]},{"id":"b174-v14-07-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"將比較重複方位讀值與獨立測量控制的方向差列為該構件的交接證據，連結到施工位置、材料批次及判讀版本。若發現固定方位偏差被當隨機誤差平均，長距離後仍偏離走廊，先保留原始紀錄並由負責技師確認處置，不能以本課算例替代核定作業計畫。","textEn":"Apply the following check at handover: Compare repeated headings with independently surveyed control directions. Link results to location, material batch and interpretation version. If a fixed heading bias is treated as random noise and the long route still leaves its corridor, retain original records and obtain the responsible engineer's disposition; this example does not replace an approved work plan.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「方位誤差與橫向漂移」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Heading error and lateral drift\"?","options":["沿用另一條隧道或另一處地層的量測結果，就可視為本工程已完成驗證。","比較重複方位讀值與獨立測量控制的方向差。","所有管材都能用同一彈性模量估算回拖應變"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another tunnel or ground formation counts as verifying this structure.","Compare repeated headings with independently surveyed control directions.","Every pipe material uses the same elastic modulus for pullback strain"],"answer":1,"explanation":"比較重複方位讀值與獨立測量控制的方向差。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Compare repeated headings with independently surveyed control directions. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":7},{"id":"b174-v14-08","title":"方位誤差與橫向漂移：失效診斷","titleEn":"Heading error and lateral drift: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"],"prerequisiteIds":["b174-v14-07"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「方位誤差與橫向漂移」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Heading error and lateral drift” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"固定方位偏差被當隨機誤差平均，長距離後仍偏離走廊。相似表徵也可能由量測偏差造成，因此應回到比較重複方位讀值與獨立測量控制的方向差，以獨立證據判別原因；只修補可見症狀將留下原本的傳力或滲流問題。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"A fixed heading bias is treated as random noise and the long route still leaves its corridor. Similar symptoms can arise from measurement bias: return to compare repeated headings with independently surveyed control directions to discriminate the cause. Treating visible symptoms alone leaves the original transfer or seepage problem unresolved. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：判別這個機制時，應觀察比較重複方位讀值與獨立測量控制的方向差；若出現固定方位偏差被當隨機誤差平均，長距離後仍偏離走廊，便須重新檢查原先假設的接觸、力或水的傳遞邊界，而不能只調整計算結果。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: If a fixed heading bias is treated as random noise and the long route still leaves its corridor, revisit the assumed contact, force or water-transfer boundary rather than merely adjusting the calculated result.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「同一導向儀讀很多次就能消除所有系統性方位偏差」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Many readings from one guidance instrument eliminate every systematic heading bias\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b174-v14-08-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"固定方位偏差被當隨機誤差平均，長距離後仍偏離走廊。相似表徵也可能由量測偏差造成，因此應回到比較重複方位讀值與獨立測量控制的方向差，以獨立證據判別原因；只修補可見症狀將留下原本的傳力或滲流問題。","textEn":"A fixed heading bias is treated as random noise and the long route still leaves its corridor. Similar symptoms can arise from measurement bias: return to compare repeated headings with independently surveyed control directions to discriminate the cause. Treating visible symptoms alone leaves the original transfer or seepage problem unresolved.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]},{"id":"b174-v14-08-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「方位誤差與橫向漂移」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Heading error and lateral drift\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。","用弧長除角度時不需要區分度數與弧度","固定方位偏差被當隨機誤差平均，長距離後仍偏離走廊。"],"optionsEn":["Adding a coat of paint or widening the acceptance limits solves most deterioration problems.","Dividing arc length by angle never requires distinguishing degrees from radians","A fixed heading bias is treated as random noise and the long route still leaves its corridor."],"answer":2,"explanation":"固定方位偏差被當隨機誤差平均，長距離後仍偏離走廊。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A fixed heading bias is treated as random noise and the long route still leaves its corridor. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":8}],"order":1},{"id":"b174-v14-s2","title":"機制、材料與定量設計","titleEn":"Mechanisms, materials and quantitative design","description":"本階段聚焦「曲率半徑與角度單位」與「工具面與地層轉向反應」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Curvature radius and angular units\" and \"Toolface and ground steering response\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b174-v14-09","title":"曲率半徑與角度單位：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Curvature radius and angular units: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"],"prerequisiteIds":["b174-v14-08"],"objective":"說明「曲率半徑與角度單位」如何影響水平定向鑽掘導向的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Curvature radius and angular units” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Horizontal directional drilling guidance”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"相鄰姿態角差與弧長決定局部曲率，但角度需轉成弧度才可直接使用半徑關係。鑽具和成品管各有不同彎曲限制，短距姿態噪聲會製造假小半徑；路徑平滑不能刪除真實局部折角的證據。 判別這個機制時，應觀察比對相鄰姿態、測距及獨立管材彎曲要求；若出現把度數直接當弧度使半徑低估數十倍，導致錯誤判讀，便須重新檢查原先假設的接觸、力或水的傳遞邊界，而不能只調整計算結果。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「曲率半徑與角度單位」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Local curvature relates arc length to attitude change, with radians required in the radius relation. Drill string and product pipe have different bending constraints, and short-baseline attitude noise can create falsely tight curvature. Smoothing the path must not erase evidence of a real localized dogleg. Use the following check to discriminate the mechanism: Compare adjacent attitudes and distances with separately established pipe-bending requirements. If using degrees directly as radians understates radius by a large factor and distorts interpretation, revisit the assumed contact, force or water-transfer boundary rather than merely adjusting the calculated result. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Curvature radius and angular units” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設：radius=arcLength/dTheta=3 m/(0.5*pi/180 rad)=343.8 m。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions: radius=arcLength/dTheta=3 m/(0.5*pi/180 rad)=343.8 m.","failure":"常見誤解：「用弧長除角度時不需要區分度數與弧度」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Dividing arc length by angle never requires distinguishing degrees from radians\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「曲率半徑與角度單位」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Curvature radius and angular units”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b174-v14-09-k1","title":"曲率半徑與角度單位","titleEn":"Curvature radius and angular units","text":"相鄰姿態角差與弧長決定局部曲率，但角度需轉成弧度才可直接使用半徑關係。鑽具和成品管各有不同彎曲限制，短距姿態噪聲會製造假小半徑；路徑平滑不能刪除真實局部折角的證據。","textEn":"Local curvature relates arc length to attitude change, with radians required in the radius relation. Drill string and product pipe have different bending constraints, and short-baseline attitude noise can create falsely tight curvature.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]},{"id":"b174-v14-09-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：用弧長除角度時不需要區分度數與弧度 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Dividing arc length by angle never requires distinguishing degrees from radians Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「曲率半徑與角度單位」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Curvature radius and angular units\" is correct?","options":["相鄰姿態角差與弧長決定局部曲率，但角度需轉成弧度才可直接使用半徑關係。","用弧長除角度時不需要區分度數與弧度","工具面偏轉角度永遠等於成孔路徑的實際轉向角"],"optionsEn":["Local curvature relates arc length to attitude change, with radians required in the radius relation.","Dividing arc length by angle never requires distinguishing degrees from radians","Toolface deflection always equals the actual turning angle of the bore"],"answer":0,"explanation":"相鄰姿態角差與弧長決定局部曲率，但角度需轉成弧度才可直接使用半徑關係。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Local curvature relates arc length to attitude change, with radians required in the radius relation. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":9},{"id":"b174-v14-10","title":"曲率半徑與角度單位：定量估算","titleEn":"Curvature radius and angular units: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"],"prerequisiteIds":["b174-v14-09"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「曲率半徑與角度單位」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Curvature radius and angular units” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設：radius=arcLength/dTheta=3 m/(0.5*pi/180 rad)=343.8 m。導向幾何與磁場算例為小偏差或單段簡化，並非鑽進路徑指令；定位不確定度、管徑及設施尺寸需另併入。 此結果僅用來核對量綱及模型敏感度，不是專案設計值、實測紀錄或現場允收門檻。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions: radius=arcLength/dTheta=3 m/(0.5*pi/180 rad)=343.8 m. Guidance geometry and magnetic examples simplify small errors or single segments and are not drilling commands; positioning uncertainty, pipe diameter and utility dimensions require separate inclusion. This checks dimensions and model sensitivity; it is neither measured project data nor a design or acceptance value. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：比對相鄰姿態、測距及獨立管材彎曲要求。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Compare adjacent attitudes and distances with separately established pipe-bending requirements.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b174-v14-10-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設：radius=arcLength/dTheta=3 m/(0.5*pi/180 rad)=343.8 m。導向幾何與磁場算例為小偏差或單段簡化，並非鑽進路徑指令；定位不確定度、管徑及設施尺寸需另併入。 此結果僅用來核對量綱及模型敏感度，不是專案設計值、實測紀錄或現場允收門檻。","textEn":"Original teaching assumptions: radius=arcLength/dTheta=3 m/(0.5*pi/180 rad)=343.8 m. Guidance geometry and magnetic examples simplify small errors or single segments and are not drilling commands; positioning uncertainty, pipe diameter and utility dimensions require separate inclusion. This checks dimensions and model sensitivity; it is neither measured project data nor a design or acceptance value.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]},{"id":"b174-v14-10-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「曲率半徑與角度單位」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Curvature radius and angular units\", which statement holds?","options":["陀螺不受磁場影響就代表永遠不會產生方位誤差","原創教學假設：radius=arcLength/dTheta=3 m/(0.5*pi/180 rad)=343.8 m。","平均環空流速正常就能排除所有冒漿風險"],"optionsEn":["A gyro immune to magnetic interference never develops heading error","Original teaching assumptions: radius=arcLength/dTheta=3 m/(0.5*pi/180 rad)=343.8 m.","Normal mean annular velocity rules out every inadvertent-return risk"],"answer":1,"explanation":"原創教學假設：radius=arcLength/dTheta=3 m/(0.5*pi/180 rad)=343.8 m。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching assumptions: radius=arcLength/dTheta=3 m/(0.5*pi/180 rad)=343.8 m. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":10},{"id":"b174-v14-11","title":"曲率半徑與角度單位：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Curvature radius and angular units: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"],"prerequisiteIds":["b174-v14-10"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「曲率半徑與角度單位」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Curvature radius and angular units” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"比對相鄰姿態、測距及獨立管材彎曲要求。量測須保存位置、時間及基準，讓同條件的重複結果可比較；並特別檢查「把度數直接當弧度使半徑低估數十倍，導致錯誤判讀」是否能由這組資料區分。儀器校核與誤差估計應先於判讀，由負責技師核定該項試驗的允收和停留點。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Compare adjacent attitudes and distances with separately established pipe-bending requirements. Retain position, time and datums for comparable repeats, specifically distinguishing this scenario: Using degrees directly as radians understates radius by a large factor and distorts interpretation. Instrument checks and uncertainty estimates precede interpretation; the responsible engineer sets acceptance and hold points for this test. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：將比對相鄰姿態、測距及獨立管材彎曲要求列為該構件的交接證據，連結到施工位置、材料批次及判讀版本。若發現把度數直接當弧度使半徑低估數十倍，導致錯誤判讀，先保留原始紀錄並由負責技師確認處置，不能以本課算例替代核定作業計畫。","observationEn":"Site practice: Apply the following check at handover: Compare adjacent attitudes and distances with separately established pipe-bending requirements. Link results to location, material batch and interpretation version. If using degrees directly as radians understates radius by a large factor and distorts interpretation, retain original records and obtain the responsible engineer's disposition; this example does not replace an approved work plan.","failure":"注意干擾：把度數直接當弧度使半徑低估數十倍，導致錯誤判讀。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Using degrees directly as radians understates radius by a large factor and distorts interpretation. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b174-v14-11-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"比對相鄰姿態、測距及獨立管材彎曲要求。量測須保存位置、時間及基準，讓同條件的重複結果可比較；並特別檢查「把度數直接當弧度使半徑低估數十倍，導致錯誤判讀」是否能由這組資料區分。儀器校核與誤差估計應先於判讀，由負責技師核定該項試驗的允收和停留點。","textEn":"Compare adjacent attitudes and distances with separately established pipe-bending requirements. Retain position, time and datums for comparable repeats, specifically distinguishing this scenario: Using degrees directly as radians understates radius by a large factor and distorts interpretation. Instrument checks and uncertainty estimates precede interpretation; the responsible engineer sets acceptance and hold points for this test.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]},{"id":"b174-v14-11-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"將比對相鄰姿態、測距及獨立管材彎曲要求列為該構件的交接證據，連結到施工位置、材料批次及判讀版本。若發現把度數直接當弧度使半徑低估數十倍，導致錯誤判讀，先保留原始紀錄並由負責技師確認處置，不能以本課算例替代核定作業計畫。","textEn":"Apply the following check at handover: Compare adjacent attitudes and distances with separately established pipe-bending requirements. Link results to location, material batch and interpretation version. If using degrees directly as radians understates radius by a large factor and distorts interpretation, retain original records and obtain the responsible engineer's disposition; this example does not replace an approved work plan.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「曲率半徑與角度單位」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Curvature radius and angular units\"?","options":["只看一次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準點、參考試體或重複量測。","終點閉合誤差小就能證明中途所有位置都正確","比對相鄰姿態、測距及獨立管材彎曲要求。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the work; no datum, reference specimen or repeat measurement is needed.","Small endpoint closure error proves every intermediate position is correct","Compare adjacent attitudes and distances with separately established pipe-bending requirements."],"answer":2,"explanation":"比對相鄰姿態、測距及獨立管材彎曲要求。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Compare adjacent attitudes and distances with separately established pipe-bending requirements. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":11},{"id":"b174-v14-12","title":"曲率半徑與角度單位：失效診斷","titleEn":"Curvature radius and angular units: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"],"prerequisiteIds":["b174-v14-11"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「曲率半徑與角度單位」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Curvature radius and angular units” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"把度數直接當弧度使半徑低估數十倍，導致錯誤判讀。相似表徵也可能由量測偏差造成，因此應回到比對相鄰姿態、測距及獨立管材彎曲要求，以獨立證據判別原因；只修補可見症狀將留下原本的傳力或滲流問題。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Using degrees directly as radians understates radius by a large factor and distorts interpretation. Similar symptoms can arise from measurement bias: return to compare adjacent attitudes and distances with separately established pipe-bending requirements to discriminate the cause. Treating visible symptoms alone leaves the original transfer or seepage problem unresolved. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：判別這個機制時，應觀察比對相鄰姿態、測距及獨立管材彎曲要求；若出現把度數直接當弧度使半徑低估數十倍，導致錯誤判讀，便須重新檢查原先假設的接觸、力或水的傳遞邊界，而不能只調整計算結果。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: If using degrees directly as radians understates radius by a large factor and distorts interpretation, revisit the assumed contact, force or water-transfer boundary rather than merely adjusting the calculated result.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「用弧長除角度時不需要區分度數與弧度」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Dividing arc length by angle never requires distinguishing degrees from radians\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b174-v14-12-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"把度數直接當弧度使半徑低估數十倍，導致錯誤判讀。相似表徵也可能由量測偏差造成，因此應回到比對相鄰姿態、測距及獨立管材彎曲要求，以獨立證據判別原因；只修補可見症狀將留下原本的傳力或滲流問題。","textEn":"Using degrees directly as radians understates radius by a large factor and distorts interpretation. Similar symptoms can arise from measurement bias: return to compare adjacent attitudes and distances with separately established pipe-bending requirements to discriminate the cause. Treating visible symptoms alone leaves the original transfer or seepage problem unresolved.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]},{"id":"b174-v14-12-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「曲率半徑與角度單位」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Curvature radius and angular units\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["把度數直接當弧度使半徑低估數十倍，導致錯誤判讀。","裂縫或異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","工具面偏轉角度永遠等於成孔路徑的實際轉向角"],"optionsEn":["Using degrees directly as radians understates radius by a large factor and distorts interpretation.","A crack or anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","Toolface deflection always equals the actual turning angle of the bore"],"answer":0,"explanation":"把度數直接當弧度使半徑低估數十倍，導致錯誤判讀。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Using degrees directly as radians understates radius by a large factor and distorts interpretation. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":12},{"id":"b174-v14-13","title":"工具面與地層轉向反應：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Toolface and ground steering response: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"],"prerequisiteIds":["b174-v14-12"],"objective":"說明「工具面與地層轉向反應」如何影響水平定向鑽掘導向的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Toolface and ground steering response” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Horizontal directional drilling guidance”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"工具面方向設定與實際軌跡轉向之間受地層、鑽頭和桿件彈性影響，並非固定一比一。觀察到的轉向增益僅適用該段與該工況，交替地層可能改變幅度和延遲；應先識別回應再談模型是否可信。 判別這個機制時，應觀察對照工具面紀錄、實測姿態變化與地層轉換里程；若出現沿用前一土層增益造成過度修正，曲率在界面集中，便須重新檢查原先假設的接觸、力或水的傳遞邊界，而不能只調整計算結果。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「工具面與地層轉向反應」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Toolface orientation does not translate one-to-one into route turning because ground, bit and rod elasticity intervene. Observed steering gain belongs to the specific segment and state; changing layers alter magnitude and delay. Identify the response before treating a steering model as transferable. Use the following check to discriminate the mechanism: Compare toolface records and measured attitude changes against geological transitions. If reusing the previous layer gain overcorrects the route and concentrates curvature at the interface, revisit the assumed contact, force or water-transfer boundary rather than merely adjusting the calculated result. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Toolface and ground steering response” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設：observedGain=actualTurn/requestedTurn=0.30 degree/0.50 degree=0.60。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions: observedGain=actualTurn/requestedTurn=0.30 degree/0.50 degree=0.60.","failure":"常見誤解：「工具面偏轉角度永遠等於成孔路徑的實際轉向角」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Toolface deflection always equals the actual turning angle of the bore\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「工具面與地層轉向反應」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Toolface and ground steering response”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b174-v14-13-k1","title":"工具面與地層轉向反應","titleEn":"Toolface and ground steering response","text":"工具面方向設定與實際軌跡轉向之間受地層、鑽頭和桿件彈性影響，並非固定一比一。觀察到的轉向增益僅適用該段與該工況，交替地層可能改變幅度和延遲；應先識別回應再談模型是否可信。","textEn":"Toolface orientation does not translate one-to-one into route turning because ground, bit and rod elasticity intervene. Observed steering gain belongs to the specific segment and state; changing layers alter magnitude and delay.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]},{"id":"b174-v14-13-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：工具面偏轉角度永遠等於成孔路徑的實際轉向角 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Toolface deflection always equals the actual turning angle of the bore Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「工具面與地層轉向反應」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Toolface and ground steering response\" is correct?","options":["工具面偏轉角度永遠等於成孔路徑的實際轉向角","工具面方向設定與實際軌跡轉向之間受地層、鑽頭和桿件彈性影響，並非固定一比一。","總磁場強度正常就能保證磁導向的方位完全準確"],"optionsEn":["Toolface deflection always equals the actual turning angle of the bore","Toolface orientation does not translate one-to-one into route turning because ground, bit and rod elasticity intervene.","Normal total magnetic intensity guarantees completely accurate magnetic heading"],"answer":1,"explanation":"工具面方向設定與實際軌跡轉向之間受地層、鑽頭和桿件彈性影響，並非固定一比一。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Toolface orientation does not translate one-to-one into route turning because ground, bit and rod elasticity intervene. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":13},{"id":"b174-v14-14","title":"工具面與地層轉向反應：定量估算","titleEn":"Toolface and ground steering response: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"],"prerequisiteIds":["b174-v14-13"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「工具面與地層轉向反應」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Toolface and ground steering response” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設：observedGain=actualTurn/requestedTurn=0.30 degree/0.50 degree=0.60。導向幾何與磁場算例為小偏差或單段簡化，並非鑽進路徑指令；定位不確定度、管徑及設施尺寸需另併入。 此結果僅用來核對量綱及模型敏感度，不是專案設計值、實測紀錄或現場允收門檻。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions: observedGain=actualTurn/requestedTurn=0.30 degree/0.50 degree=0.60. Guidance geometry and magnetic examples simplify small errors or single segments and are not drilling commands; positioning uncertainty, pipe diameter and utility dimensions require separate inclusion. This checks dimensions and model sensitivity; it is neither measured project data nor a design or acceptance value. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：對照工具面紀錄、實測姿態變化與地層轉換里程。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Compare toolface records and measured attitude changes against geological transitions.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b174-v14-14-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設：observedGain=actualTurn/requestedTurn=0.30 degree/0.50 degree=0.60。導向幾何與磁場算例為小偏差或單段簡化，並非鑽進路徑指令；定位不確定度、管徑及設施尺寸需另併入。 此結果僅用來核對量綱及模型敏感度，不是專案設計值、實測紀錄或現場允收門檻。","textEn":"Original teaching assumptions: observedGain=actualTurn/requestedTurn=0.30 degree/0.50 degree=0.60. Guidance geometry and magnetic examples simplify small errors or single segments and are not drilling commands; positioning uncertainty, pipe diameter and utility dimensions require separate inclusion. This checks dimensions and model sensitivity; it is neither measured project data nor a design or acceptance value.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]},{"id":"b174-v14-14-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「工具面與地層轉向反應」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Toolface and ground steering response\", which statement holds?","options":["圖上的中心距大於零就代表鑽孔與設施一定不接觸","所有管材都能用同一彈性模量估算回拖應變","原創教學假設：observedGain=actualTurn/requestedTurn=0.30 degree/0.50 degree=0.60。"],"optionsEn":["Positive centerline separation on a map guarantees bore and utility do not touch","Every pipe material uses the same elastic modulus for pullback strain","Original teaching assumptions: observedGain=actualTurn/requestedTurn=0.30 degree/0.50 degree=0.60."],"answer":2,"explanation":"原創教學假設：observedGain=actualTurn/requestedTurn=0.30 degree/0.50 degree=0.60。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching assumptions: observedGain=actualTurn/requestedTurn=0.30 degree/0.50 degree=0.60. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":14},{"id":"b174-v14-15","title":"工具面與地層轉向反應：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Toolface and ground steering response: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"],"prerequisiteIds":["b174-v14-14"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「工具面與地層轉向反應」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Toolface and ground steering response” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"對照工具面紀錄、實測姿態變化與地層轉換里程。量測須保存位置、時間及基準，讓同條件的重複結果可比較；並特別檢查「沿用前一土層增益造成過度修正，曲率在界面集中」是否能由這組資料區分。儀器校核與誤差估計應先於判讀，由負責技師核定該項試驗的允收和停留點。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Compare toolface records and measured attitude changes against geological transitions. Retain position, time and datums for comparable repeats, specifically distinguishing this scenario: Reusing the previous layer gain overcorrects the route and concentrates curvature at the interface. Instrument checks and uncertainty estimates precede interpretation; the responsible engineer sets acceptance and hold points for this test. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：將對照工具面紀錄、實測姿態變化與地層轉換里程列為該構件的交接證據，連結到施工位置、材料批次及判讀版本。若發現沿用前一土層增益造成過度修正，曲率在界面集中，先保留原始紀錄並由負責技師確認處置，不能以本課算例替代核定作業計畫。","observationEn":"Site practice: Apply the following check at handover: Compare toolface records and measured attitude changes against geological transitions. Link results to location, material batch and interpretation version. If reusing the previous layer gain overcorrects the route and concentrates curvature at the interface, retain original records and obtain the responsible engineer's disposition; this example does not replace an approved work plan.","failure":"注意干擾：沿用前一土層增益造成過度修正，曲率在界面集中。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Reusing the previous layer gain overcorrects the route and concentrates curvature at the interface. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b174-v14-15-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"對照工具面紀錄、實測姿態變化與地層轉換里程。量測須保存位置、時間及基準，讓同條件的重複結果可比較；並特別檢查「沿用前一土層增益造成過度修正，曲率在界面集中」是否能由這組資料區分。儀器校核與誤差估計應先於判讀，由負責技師核定該項試驗的允收和停留點。","textEn":"Compare toolface records and measured attitude changes against geological transitions. Retain position, time and datums for comparable repeats, specifically distinguishing this scenario: Reusing the previous layer gain overcorrects the route and concentrates curvature at the interface. Instrument checks and uncertainty estimates precede interpretation; the responsible engineer sets acceptance and hold points for this test.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]},{"id":"b174-v14-15-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"將對照工具面紀錄、實測姿態變化與地層轉換里程列為該構件的交接證據，連結到施工位置、材料批次及判讀版本。若發現沿用前一土層增益造成過度修正，曲率在界面集中，先保留原始紀錄並由負責技師確認處置，不能以本課算例替代核定作業計畫。","textEn":"Apply the following check at handover: Compare toolface records and measured attitude changes against geological transitions. Link results to location, material batch and interpretation version. If reusing the previous layer gain overcorrects the route and concentrates curvature at the interface, retain original records and obtain the responsible engineer's disposition; this example does not replace an approved work plan.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「工具面與地層轉向反應」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Toolface and ground steering response\"?","options":["對照工具面紀錄、實測姿態變化與地層轉換里程。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","鑽桿末端傾角一定等於整根鑽桿的平均傾角"],"optionsEn":["Compare toolface records and measured attitude changes against geological transitions.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","The rod-end inclination always equals the mean inclination of the whole rod"],"answer":0,"explanation":"對照工具面紀錄、實測姿態變化與地層轉換里程。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Compare toolface records and measured attitude changes against geological transitions. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":15},{"id":"b174-v14-16","title":"工具面與地層轉向反應：失效診斷","titleEn":"Toolface and ground steering response: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"],"prerequisiteIds":["b174-v14-15"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「工具面與地層轉向反應」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Toolface and ground steering response” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"沿用前一土層增益造成過度修正，曲率在界面集中。相似表徵也可能由量測偏差造成，因此應回到對照工具面紀錄、實測姿態變化與地層轉換里程，以獨立證據判別原因；只修補可見症狀將留下原本的傳力或滲流問題。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Reusing the previous layer gain overcorrects the route and concentrates curvature at the interface. Similar symptoms can arise from measurement bias: return to compare toolface records and measured attitude changes against geological transitions to discriminate the cause. Treating visible symptoms alone leaves the original transfer or seepage problem unresolved. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：判別這個機制時，應觀察對照工具面紀錄、實測姿態變化與地層轉換里程；若出現沿用前一土層增益造成過度修正，曲率在界面集中，便須重新檢查原先假設的接觸、力或水的傳遞邊界，而不能只調整計算結果。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: If reusing the previous layer gain overcorrects the route and concentrates curvature at the interface, revisit the assumed contact, force or water-transfer boundary rather than merely adjusting the calculated result.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「工具面偏轉角度永遠等於成孔路徑的實際轉向角」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Toolface deflection always equals the actual turning angle of the bore\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b174-v14-16-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"沿用前一土層增益造成過度修正，曲率在界面集中。相似表徵也可能由量測偏差造成，因此應回到對照工具面紀錄、實測姿態變化與地層轉換里程，以獨立證據判別原因；只修補可見症狀將留下原本的傳力或滲流問題。","textEn":"Reusing the previous layer gain overcorrects the route and concentrates curvature at the interface. Similar symptoms can arise from measurement bias: return to compare toolface records and measured attitude changes against geological transitions to discriminate the cause. Treating visible symptoms alone leaves the original transfer or seepage problem unresolved.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]},{"id":"b174-v14-16-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「工具面與地層轉向反應」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Toolface and ground steering response\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","沿用前一土層增益造成過度修正，曲率在界面集中。","總磁場強度正常就能保證磁導向的方位完全準確"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive component first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","Reusing the previous layer gain overcorrects the route and concentrates curvature at the interface.","Normal total magnetic intensity guarantees completely accurate magnetic heading"],"answer":1,"explanation":"沿用前一土層增益造成過度修正，曲率在界面集中。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Reusing the previous layer gain overcorrects the route and concentrates curvature at the interface. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":16}],"order":2},{"id":"b174-v14-s3","title":"施工方法與施工階段控制","titleEn":"Construction methods and stage control","description":"本階段聚焦「磁場干擾與方位可信度」與「陀螺漂移與時間校核」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Magnetic interference and heading confidence\" and \"Gyro drift and time checks\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b174-v14-17","title":"磁場干擾與方位可信度：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Magnetic interference and heading confidence: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"],"prerequisiteIds":["b174-v14-16"],"objective":"說明「磁場干擾與方位可信度」如何影響水平定向鑽掘導向的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Magnetic interference and heading confidence” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Horizontal directional drilling guidance”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"磁導向依賴地磁向量，埋設鋼材、電流及鄰近設施會改變局部場。簡單橫向擾動模型可顯示方位敏感度，但傾角補償與三維磁異常需另評估；總磁場強度接近正常也不能保證方向不偏。 判別這個機制時，應觀察比較三軸磁場、設備位置與非磁性導向或測量證據；若出現局部鋼材扭轉磁場方向，總場近正常卻方位已偏移，便須重新檢查原先假設的接觸、力或水的傳遞邊界，而不能只調整計算結果。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「磁場干擾與方位可信度」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Magnetic guidance depends on the field vector, disturbed by buried steel, electrical currents and nearby structures. A simple transverse perturbation illustrates heading sensitivity, while tilt compensation and three-dimensional anomalies require separate assessment. A near-normal field magnitude does not prove an unbiased field direction. Use the following check to discriminate the mechanism: Compare three-axis magnetic fields and equipment positions with nonmagnetic guidance or survey evidence. If local steel rotates the field while near-normal magnitude conceals heading bias, revisit the assumed contact, force or water-transfer boundary rather than merely adjusting the calculated result. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Magnetic interference and heading confidence” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設：headingBias=atan(Btransverse/Breference)=atan(0.5 uT/20 uT)=1.432 degrees。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions: headingBias=atan(Btransverse/Breference)=atan(0.5 uT/20 uT)=1.432 degrees.","failure":"常見誤解：「總磁場強度正常就能保證磁導向的方位完全準確」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Normal total magnetic intensity guarantees completely accurate magnetic heading\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「磁場干擾與方位可信度」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Magnetic interference and heading confidence”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b174-v14-17-k1","title":"磁場干擾與方位可信度","titleEn":"Magnetic interference and heading confidence","text":"磁導向依賴地磁向量，埋設鋼材、電流及鄰近設施會改變局部場。簡單橫向擾動模型可顯示方位敏感度，但傾角補償與三維磁異常需另評估；總磁場強度接近正常也不能保證方向不偏。","textEn":"Magnetic guidance depends on the field vector, disturbed by buried steel, electrical currents and nearby structures. A simple transverse perturbation illustrates heading sensitivity, while tilt compensation and three-dimensional anomalies require separate assessment.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]},{"id":"b174-v14-17-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：總磁場強度正常就能保證磁導向的方位完全準確 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Normal total magnetic intensity guarantees completely accurate magnetic heading Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「磁場干擾與方位可信度」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Magnetic interference and heading confidence\" is correct?","options":["總磁場強度正常就能保證磁導向的方位完全準確","陀螺不受磁場影響就代表永遠不會產生方位誤差","磁導向依賴地磁向量，埋設鋼材、電流及鄰近設施會改變局部場。"],"optionsEn":["Normal total magnetic intensity guarantees completely accurate magnetic heading","A gyro immune to magnetic interference never develops heading error","Magnetic guidance depends on the field vector, disturbed by buried steel, electrical currents and nearby structures."],"answer":2,"explanation":"磁導向依賴地磁向量，埋設鋼材、電流及鄰近設施會改變局部場。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Magnetic guidance depends on the field vector, disturbed by buried steel, electrical currents and nearby structures. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":17},{"id":"b174-v14-18","title":"磁場干擾與方位可信度：定量估算","titleEn":"Magnetic interference and heading confidence: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"],"prerequisiteIds":["b174-v14-17"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「磁場干擾與方位可信度」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Magnetic interference and heading confidence” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設：headingBias=atan(Btransverse/Breference)=atan(0.5 uT/20 uT)=1.432 degrees。導向幾何與磁場算例為小偏差或單段簡化，並非鑽進路徑指令；定位不確定度、管徑及設施尺寸需另併入。 此結果僅用來核對量綱及模型敏感度，不是專案設計值、實測紀錄或現場允收門檻。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions: headingBias=atan(Btransverse/Breference)=atan(0.5 uT/20 uT)=1.432 degrees. Guidance geometry and magnetic examples simplify small errors or single segments and are not drilling commands; positioning uncertainty, pipe diameter and utility dimensions require separate inclusion. This checks dimensions and model sensitivity; it is neither measured project data nor a design or acceptance value. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：比較三軸磁場、設備位置與非磁性導向或測量證據。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Compare three-axis magnetic fields and equipment positions with nonmagnetic guidance or survey evidence.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b174-v14-18-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設：headingBias=atan(Btransverse/Breference)=atan(0.5 uT/20 uT)=1.432 degrees。導向幾何與磁場算例為小偏差或單段簡化，並非鑽進路徑指令；定位不確定度、管徑及設施尺寸需另併入。 此結果僅用來核對量綱及模型敏感度，不是專案設計值、實測紀錄或現場允收門檻。","textEn":"Original teaching assumptions: headingBias=atan(Btransverse/Breference)=atan(0.5 uT/20 uT)=1.432 degrees. Guidance geometry and magnetic examples simplify small errors or single segments and are not drilling commands; positioning uncertainty, pipe diameter and utility dimensions require separate inclusion. This checks dimensions and model sensitivity; it is neither measured project data nor a design or acceptance value.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]},{"id":"b174-v14-18-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「磁場干擾與方位可信度」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Magnetic interference and heading confidence\", which statement holds?","options":["原創教學假設：headingBias=atan(Btransverse/Breference)=atan(0.5 uT/20 uT)=1.432 degrees。","平均環空流速正常就能排除所有冒漿風險","終點閉合誤差小就能證明中途所有位置都正確"],"optionsEn":["Original teaching assumptions: headingBias=atan(Btransverse/Breference)=atan(0.5 uT/20 uT)=1.432 degrees.","Normal mean annular velocity rules out every inadvertent-return risk","Small endpoint closure error proves every intermediate position is correct"],"answer":0,"explanation":"原創教學假設：headingBias=atan(Btransverse/Breference)=atan(0.5 uT/20 uT)=1.432 degrees。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching assumptions: headingBias=atan(Btransverse/Breference)=atan(0.5 uT/20 uT)=1.432 degrees. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":18},{"id":"b174-v14-19","title":"磁場干擾與方位可信度：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Magnetic interference and heading confidence: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"],"prerequisiteIds":["b174-v14-18"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「磁場干擾與方位可信度」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Magnetic interference and heading confidence” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"比較三軸磁場、設備位置與非磁性導向或測量證據。量測須保存位置、時間及基準，讓同條件的重複結果可比較；並特別檢查「局部鋼材扭轉磁場方向，總場近正常卻方位已偏移」是否能由這組資料區分。儀器校核與誤差估計應先於判讀，由負責技師核定該項試驗的允收和停留點。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Compare three-axis magnetic fields and equipment positions with nonmagnetic guidance or survey evidence. Retain position, time and datums for comparable repeats, specifically distinguishing this scenario: Local steel rotates the field while near-normal magnitude conceals heading bias. Instrument checks and uncertainty estimates precede interpretation; the responsible engineer sets acceptance and hold points for this test. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：將比較三軸磁場、設備位置與非磁性導向或測量證據列為該構件的交接證據，連結到施工位置、材料批次及判讀版本。若發現局部鋼材扭轉磁場方向，總場近正常卻方位已偏移，先保留原始紀錄並由負責技師確認處置，不能以本課算例替代核定作業計畫。","observationEn":"Site practice: Apply the following check at handover: Compare three-axis magnetic fields and equipment positions with nonmagnetic guidance or survey evidence. Link results to location, material batch and interpretation version. If local steel rotates the field while near-normal magnitude conceals heading bias, retain original records and obtain the responsible engineer's disposition; this example does not replace an approved work plan.","failure":"注意干擾：局部鋼材扭轉磁場方向，總場近正常卻方位已偏移。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Local steel rotates the field while near-normal magnitude conceals heading bias. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b174-v14-19-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"比較三軸磁場、設備位置與非磁性導向或測量證據。量測須保存位置、時間及基準，讓同條件的重複結果可比較；並特別檢查「局部鋼材扭轉磁場方向，總場近正常卻方位已偏移」是否能由這組資料區分。儀器校核與誤差估計應先於判讀，由負責技師核定該項試驗的允收和停留點。","textEn":"Compare three-axis magnetic fields and equipment positions with nonmagnetic guidance or survey evidence. Retain position, time and datums for comparable repeats, specifically distinguishing this scenario: Local steel rotates the field while near-normal magnitude conceals heading bias. Instrument checks and uncertainty estimates precede interpretation; the responsible engineer sets acceptance and hold points for this test.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]},{"id":"b174-v14-19-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"將比較三軸磁場、設備位置與非磁性導向或測量證據列為該構件的交接證據，連結到施工位置、材料批次及判讀版本。若發現局部鋼材扭轉磁場方向，總場近正常卻方位已偏移，先保留原始紀錄並由負責技師確認處置，不能以本課算例替代核定作業計畫。","textEn":"Apply the following check at handover: Compare three-axis magnetic fields and equipment positions with nonmagnetic guidance or survey evidence. Link results to location, material batch and interpretation version. If local steel rotates the field while near-normal magnitude conceals heading bias, retain original records and obtain the responsible engineer's disposition; this example does not replace an approved work plan.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「磁場干擾與方位可信度」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Magnetic interference and heading confidence\"?","options":["允收準則可以等看到量測數據後再決定。","比較三軸磁場、設備位置與非磁性導向或測量證據。","同一導向儀讀很多次就能消除所有系統性方位偏差"],"optionsEn":["Acceptance criteria can be decided after the measured data have been seen.","Compare three-axis magnetic fields and equipment positions with nonmagnetic guidance or survey evidence.","Many readings from one guidance instrument eliminate every systematic heading bias"],"answer":1,"explanation":"比較三軸磁場、設備位置與非磁性導向或測量證據。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Compare three-axis magnetic fields and equipment positions with nonmagnetic guidance or survey evidence. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":19},{"id":"b174-v14-20","title":"磁場干擾與方位可信度：失效診斷","titleEn":"Magnetic interference and heading confidence: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"],"prerequisiteIds":["b174-v14-19"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「磁場干擾與方位可信度」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Magnetic interference and heading confidence” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"局部鋼材扭轉磁場方向，總場近正常卻方位已偏移。相似表徵也可能由量測偏差造成，因此應回到比較三軸磁場、設備位置與非磁性導向或測量證據，以獨立證據判別原因；只修補可見症狀將留下原本的傳力或滲流問題。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Local steel rotates the field while near-normal magnitude conceals heading bias. Similar symptoms can arise from measurement bias: return to compare three-axis magnetic fields and equipment positions with nonmagnetic guidance or survey evidence to discriminate the cause. Treating visible symptoms alone leaves the original transfer or seepage problem unresolved. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：判別這個機制時，應觀察比較三軸磁場、設備位置與非磁性導向或測量證據；若出現局部鋼材扭轉磁場方向，總場近正常卻方位已偏移，便須重新檢查原先假設的接觸、力或水的傳遞邊界，而不能只調整計算結果。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: If local steel rotates the field while near-normal magnitude conceals heading bias, revisit the assumed contact, force or water-transfer boundary rather than merely adjusting the calculated result.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「總磁場強度正常就能保證磁導向的方位完全準確」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Normal total magnetic intensity guarantees completely accurate magnetic heading\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b174-v14-20-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"局部鋼材扭轉磁場方向，總場近正常卻方位已偏移。相似表徵也可能由量測偏差造成，因此應回到比較三軸磁場、設備位置與非磁性導向或測量證據，以獨立證據判別原因；只修補可見症狀將留下原本的傳力或滲流問題。","textEn":"Local steel rotates the field while near-normal magnitude conceals heading bias. Similar symptoms can arise from measurement bias: return to compare three-axis magnetic fields and equipment positions with nonmagnetic guidance or survey evidence to discriminate the cause. Treating visible symptoms alone leaves the original transfer or seepage problem unresolved.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]},{"id":"b174-v14-20-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「磁場干擾與方位可信度」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Magnetic interference and heading confidence\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["症狀相同就代表原因相同，不必用量測區分。","陀螺不受磁場影響就代表永遠不會產生方位誤差","局部鋼材扭轉磁場方向，總場近正常卻方位已偏移。"],"optionsEn":["Identical symptoms always mean identical causes, so no discriminating measurement is needed.","A gyro immune to magnetic interference never develops heading error","Local steel rotates the field while near-normal magnitude conceals heading bias."],"answer":2,"explanation":"局部鋼材扭轉磁場方向，總場近正常卻方位已偏移。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Local steel rotates the field while near-normal magnitude conceals heading bias. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":20},{"id":"b174-v14-21","title":"陀螺漂移與時間校核：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Gyro drift and time checks: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"],"prerequisiteIds":["b174-v14-20"],"objective":"說明「陀螺漂移與時間校核」如何影響水平定向鑽掘導向的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Gyro drift and time checks” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Horizontal directional drilling guidance”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"陀螺可避免部分磁干擾，但零偏會隨積分時間累積，溫度和振動又可能改變偏差。恆定漂移假設適合看時間敏感度，不保證實際誤差線性；獨立起始方位與週期校核需連到每段資料的時間戳。 判別這個機制時，應觀察對照陀螺溫度、時間戳與獨立方位閉合差；若出現重啟後沿用舊零偏，磁場雖無影響仍產生路線漂移，便須重新檢查原先假設的接觸、力或水的傳遞邊界，而不能只調整計算結果。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「陀螺漂移與時間校核」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"A gyro avoids some magnetic disturbance, but bias accumulates with integration time and can vary with temperature and vibration. Constant drift illustrates time sensitivity without guaranteeing linear real error. Independent initial heading and periodic checks must be linked to each segment timestamp. Use the following check to discriminate the mechanism: Compare gyro temperature and timestamps with independent heading-closure error. If reusing an old bias after restart creates route drift despite freedom from magnetic interference, revisit the assumed contact, force or water-transfer boundary rather than merely adjusting the calculated result. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Gyro drift and time checks” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設：angleDrift=0.02 degree/h*0.5 h=0.010 degree; finalAngleProjection=200 m*tan(0.010 degree)=0.0349 m assuming the final angle applies over the entire length; not a time-integrated guidance path error。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions: angleDrift=0.02 degree/h*0.5 h=0.010 degree; finalAngleProjection=200 m*tan(0.010 degree)=0.0349 m assuming the final angle applies over the entire length; not a time-integrated guidance path error.","failure":"常見誤解：「陀螺不受磁場影響就代表永遠不會產生方位誤差」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A gyro immune to magnetic interference never develops heading error\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「陀螺漂移與時間校核」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Gyro drift and time checks”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b174-v14-21-k1","title":"陀螺漂移與時間校核","titleEn":"Gyro drift and time checks","text":"陀螺可避免部分磁干擾，但零偏會隨積分時間累積，溫度和振動又可能改變偏差。恆定漂移假設適合看時間敏感度，不保證實際誤差線性；獨立起始方位與週期校核需連到每段資料的時間戳。","textEn":"A gyro avoids some magnetic disturbance, but bias accumulates with integration time and can vary with temperature and vibration. Constant drift illustrates time sensitivity without guaranteeing linear real error.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]},{"id":"b174-v14-21-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：陀螺不受磁場影響就代表永遠不會產生方位誤差 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A gyro immune to magnetic interference never develops heading error Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「陀螺漂移與時間校核」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Gyro drift and time checks\" is correct?","options":["陀螺可避免部分磁干擾，但零偏會隨積分時間累積，溫度和振動又可能改變偏差。","陀螺不受磁場影響就代表永遠不會產生方位誤差","圖上的中心距大於零就代表鑽孔與設施一定不接觸"],"optionsEn":["A gyro avoids some magnetic disturbance, but bias accumulates with integration time and can vary with temperature and vibration.","A gyro immune to magnetic interference never develops heading error","Positive centerline separation on a map guarantees bore and utility do not touch"],"answer":0,"explanation":"陀螺可避免部分磁干擾，但零偏會隨積分時間累積，溫度和振動又可能改變偏差。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"A gyro avoids some magnetic disturbance, but bias accumulates with integration time and can vary with temperature and vibration. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":21},{"id":"b174-v14-22","title":"陀螺漂移與時間校核：定量估算","titleEn":"Gyro drift and time checks: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"],"prerequisiteIds":["b174-v14-21"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「陀螺漂移與時間校核」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Gyro drift and time checks” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設：angleDrift=0.02 degree/h*0.5 h=0.010 degree; finalAngleProjection=200 m*tan(0.010 degree)=0.0349 m assuming the final angle applies over the entire length; not a time-integrated guidance path error。導向幾何與磁場算例為小偏差或單段簡化，並非鑽進路徑指令；定位不確定度、管徑及設施尺寸需另併入。 此結果僅用來核對量綱及模型敏感度，不是專案設計值、實測紀錄或現場允收門檻。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions: angleDrift=0.02 degree/h*0.5 h=0.010 degree; finalAngleProjection=200 m*tan(0.010 degree)=0.0349 m assuming the final angle applies over the entire length; not a time-integrated guidance path error. Guidance geometry and magnetic examples simplify small errors or single segments and are not drilling commands; positioning uncertainty, pipe diameter and utility dimensions require separate inclusion. This checks dimensions and model sensitivity; it is neither measured project data nor a design or acceptance value. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：對照陀螺溫度、時間戳與獨立方位閉合差。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Compare gyro temperature and timestamps with independent heading-closure error.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b174-v14-22-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設：angleDrift=0.02 degree/h*0.5 h=0.010 degree; finalAngleProjection=200 m*tan(0.010 degree)=0.0349 m assuming the final angle applies over the entire length; not a time-integrated guidance path error。導向幾何與磁場算例為小偏差或單段簡化，並非鑽進路徑指令；定位不確定度、管徑及設施尺寸需另併入。 此結果僅用來核對量綱及模型敏感度，不是專案設計值、實測紀錄或現場允收門檻。","textEn":"Original teaching assumptions: angleDrift=0.02 degree/h*0.5 h=0.010 degree; finalAngleProjection=200 m*tan(0.010 degree)=0.0349 m assuming the final angle applies over the entire length; not a time-integrated guidance path error. Guidance geometry and magnetic examples simplify small errors or single segments and are not drilling commands; positioning uncertainty, pipe diameter and utility dimensions require separate inclusion. This checks dimensions and model sensitivity; it is neither measured project data nor a design or acceptance value.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]},{"id":"b174-v14-22-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「陀螺漂移與時間校核」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Gyro drift and time checks\", which statement holds?","options":["所有管材都能用同一彈性模量估算回拖應變","原創教學假設：angleDrift=0.02 degree/h*0.5 h=0.010 degree; finalAngleProjection=200 m*tan(0.010 degree)=0.0349 m assuming the final angle applies over the entire length; not a time-integrated guidance path error。","鑽桿末端傾角一定等於整根鑽桿的平均傾角"],"optionsEn":["Every pipe material uses the same elastic modulus for pullback strain","Original teaching assumptions: angleDrift=0.02 degree/h*0.5 h=0.010 degree.","The rod-end inclination always equals the mean inclination of the whole rod"],"answer":1,"explanation":"原創教學假設：angleDrift=0.02 degree/h*0.5 h=0.010 degree; finalAngleProjection=200 m*tan(0.010 degree)=0.0349 m assuming the final angle applies over the entire length; not a time-integrated guidance path error。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching assumptions: angleDrift=0.02 degree/h*0.5 h=0.010 degree; finalAngleProjection=200 m*tan(0.010 degree)=0.0349 m assuming the final angle applies over the entire length; not a time-integrated guidance path error. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":22},{"id":"b174-v14-23","title":"陀螺漂移與時間校核：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Gyro drift and time checks: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"],"prerequisiteIds":["b174-v14-22"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「陀螺漂移與時間校核」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Gyro drift and time checks” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"對照陀螺溫度、時間戳與獨立方位閉合差。量測須保存位置、時間及基準，讓同條件的重複結果可比較；並特別檢查「重啟後沿用舊零偏，磁場雖無影響仍產生路線漂移」是否能由這組資料區分。儀器校核與誤差估計應先於判讀，由負責技師核定該項試驗的允收和停留點。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Compare gyro temperature and timestamps with independent heading-closure error. Retain position, time and datums for comparable repeats, specifically distinguishing this scenario: Reusing an old bias after restart creates route drift despite freedom from magnetic interference. Instrument checks and uncertainty estimates precede interpretation; the responsible engineer sets acceptance and hold points for this test. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：將對照陀螺溫度、時間戳與獨立方位閉合差列為該構件的交接證據，連結到施工位置、材料批次及判讀版本。若發現重啟後沿用舊零偏，磁場雖無影響仍產生路線漂移，先保留原始紀錄並由負責技師確認處置，不能以本課算例替代核定作業計畫。","observationEn":"Site practice: Apply the following check at handover: Compare gyro temperature and timestamps with independent heading-closure error. Link results to location, material batch and interpretation version. If reusing an old bias after restart creates route drift despite freedom from magnetic interference, retain original records and obtain the responsible engineer's disposition; this example does not replace an approved work plan.","failure":"注意干擾：重啟後沿用舊零偏，磁場雖無影響仍產生路線漂移。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Reusing an old bias after restart creates route drift despite freedom from magnetic interference. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b174-v14-23-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"對照陀螺溫度、時間戳與獨立方位閉合差。量測須保存位置、時間及基準，讓同條件的重複結果可比較；並特別檢查「重啟後沿用舊零偏，磁場雖無影響仍產生路線漂移」是否能由這組資料區分。儀器校核與誤差估計應先於判讀，由負責技師核定該項試驗的允收和停留點。","textEn":"Compare gyro temperature and timestamps with independent heading-closure error. Retain position, time and datums for comparable repeats, specifically distinguishing this scenario: Reusing an old bias after restart creates route drift despite freedom from magnetic interference. Instrument checks and uncertainty estimates precede interpretation; the responsible engineer sets acceptance and hold points for this test.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]},{"id":"b174-v14-23-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"將對照陀螺溫度、時間戳與獨立方位閉合差列為該構件的交接證據，連結到施工位置、材料批次及判讀版本。若發現重啟後沿用舊零偏，磁場雖無影響仍產生路線漂移，先保留原始紀錄並由負責技師確認處置，不能以本課算例替代核定作業計畫。","textEn":"Apply the following check at handover: Compare gyro temperature and timestamps with independent heading-closure error. Link results to location, material batch and interpretation version. If reusing an old bias after restart creates route drift despite freedom from magnetic interference, retain original records and obtain the responsible engineer's disposition; this example does not replace an approved work plan.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「陀螺漂移與時間校核」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Gyro drift and time checks\"?","options":["只要結構分析模型看起來合理，就可以省略現場量測與試驗。","用弧長除角度時不需要區分度數與弧度","對照陀螺溫度、時間戳與獨立方位閉合差。"],"optionsEn":["If the structural model looks reasonable, site measurement and testing can be skipped.","Dividing arc length by angle never requires distinguishing degrees from radians","Compare gyro temperature and timestamps with independent heading-closure error."],"answer":2,"explanation":"對照陀螺溫度、時間戳與獨立方位閉合差。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Compare gyro temperature and timestamps with independent heading-closure error. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":23},{"id":"b174-v14-24","title":"陀螺漂移與時間校核：失效診斷","titleEn":"Gyro drift and time checks: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"],"prerequisiteIds":["b174-v14-23"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「陀螺漂移與時間校核」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Gyro drift and time checks” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"重啟後沿用舊零偏，磁場雖無影響仍產生路線漂移。相似表徵也可能由量測偏差造成，因此應回到對照陀螺溫度、時間戳與獨立方位閉合差，以獨立證據判別原因；只修補可見症狀將留下原本的傳力或滲流問題。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Reusing an old bias after restart creates route drift despite freedom from magnetic interference. Similar symptoms can arise from measurement bias: return to compare gyro temperature and timestamps with independent heading-closure error to discriminate the cause. Treating visible symptoms alone leaves the original transfer or seepage problem unresolved. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：判別這個機制時，應觀察對照陀螺溫度、時間戳與獨立方位閉合差；若出現重啟後沿用舊零偏，磁場雖無影響仍產生路線漂移，便須重新檢查原先假設的接觸、力或水的傳遞邊界，而不能只調整計算結果。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: If reusing an old bias after restart creates route drift despite freedom from magnetic interference, revisit the assumed contact, force or water-transfer boundary rather than merely adjusting the calculated result.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「陀螺不受磁場影響就代表永遠不會產生方位誤差」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A gyro immune to magnetic interference never develops heading error\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b174-v14-24-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"重啟後沿用舊零偏，磁場雖無影響仍產生路線漂移。相似表徵也可能由量測偏差造成，因此應回到對照陀螺溫度、時間戳與獨立方位閉合差，以獨立證據判別原因；只修補可見症狀將留下原本的傳力或滲流問題。","textEn":"Reusing an old bias after restart creates route drift despite freedom from magnetic interference. Similar symptoms can arise from measurement bias: return to compare gyro temperature and timestamps with independent heading-closure error to discriminate the cause. Treating visible symptoms alone leaves the original transfer or seepage problem unresolved.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]},{"id":"b174-v14-24-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「陀螺漂移與時間校核」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Gyro drift and time checks\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["重啟後沿用舊零偏，磁場雖無影響仍產生路線漂移。","只要結構還沒倒，就代表安全餘裕仍然足夠。","圖上的中心距大於零就代表鑽孔與設施一定不接觸"],"optionsEn":["Reusing an old bias after restart creates route drift despite freedom from magnetic interference.","As long as the structure is still standing, its safety margin must still be adequate.","Positive centerline separation on a map guarantees bore and utility do not touch"],"answer":0,"explanation":"重啟後沿用舊零偏，磁場雖無影響仍產生路線漂移。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Reusing an old bias after restart creates route drift despite freedom from magnetic interference. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":24}],"order":3},{"id":"b174-v14-s4","title":"試驗、量測與監測驗證","titleEn":"Testing, measurement and monitoring","description":"本階段聚焦「設施淨距與不確定度」與「環空輸送與孔內壓力」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Utility clearance and uncertainty\" and \"Annular transport and bore pressure\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b174-v14-25","title":"設施淨距與不確定度：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Utility clearance and uncertainty: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"],"prerequisiteIds":["b174-v14-24"],"objective":"說明「設施淨距與不確定度」如何影響水平定向鑽掘導向的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Utility clearance and uncertainty” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Horizontal directional drilling guidance”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"地下設施的中心線位置、外徑和調查精度都影響真正淨距，圖上中心距不是可用安全間隔。不確定度扣減需明示保守或統計規則，還要扣除兩者尺寸；未知設施不能因地圖空白就視為不存在。 判別這個機制時，應觀察逐一核對設施實測位置、外徑及定位不確定度；若出現只比較中心線距離而漏扣半徑，使實際外表面互相侵入，便須重新檢查原先假設的接觸、力或水的傳遞邊界，而不能只調整計算結果。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「設施淨距與不確定度」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"True utility clearance depends on centerline location, outside dimensions and survey uncertainty; map center distance is not available separation. State conservative or statistical uncertainty rules and subtract both object dimensions. A blank map does not establish that unknown services are absent from the route. Use the following check to discriminate the mechanism: Check surveyed utility position, outside diameter and positioning uncertainty individually. If comparing centerlines without radii allows actual external surfaces to intersect, revisit the assumed contact, force or water-transfer boundary rather than merely adjusting the calculated result. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Utility clearance and uncertainty” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設：centerDistance=sqrt((0.30 m)^2+(0.40 m)^2)=0.50 m; afterConservativeUncertainty=0.50-0.10-0.15=0.25 m before subtracting radii。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions: centerDistance=sqrt((0.30 m)^2+(0.40 m)^2)=0.50 m; afterConservativeUncertainty=0.50-0.10-0.15=0.25 m before subtracting radii.","failure":"常見誤解：「圖上的中心距大於零就代表鑽孔與設施一定不接觸」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Positive centerline separation on a map guarantees bore and utility do not touch\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「設施淨距與不確定度」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Utility clearance and uncertainty”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b174-v14-25-k1","title":"設施淨距與不確定度","titleEn":"Utility clearance and uncertainty","text":"地下設施的中心線位置、外徑和調查精度都影響真正淨距，圖上中心距不是可用安全間隔。不確定度扣減需明示保守或統計規則，還要扣除兩者尺寸；未知設施不能因地圖空白就視為不存在。","textEn":"True utility clearance depends on centerline location, outside dimensions and survey uncertainty; map center distance is not available separation. State conservative or statistical uncertainty rules and subtract both object dimensions.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]},{"id":"b174-v14-25-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：圖上的中心距大於零就代表鑽孔與設施一定不接觸 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Positive centerline separation on a map guarantees bore and utility do not touch Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「設施淨距與不確定度」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Utility clearance and uncertainty\" is correct?","options":["圖上的中心距大於零就代表鑽孔與設施一定不接觸","地下設施的中心線位置、外徑和調查精度都影響真正淨距，圖上中心距不是可用安全間隔。","平均環空流速正常就能排除所有冒漿風險"],"optionsEn":["Positive centerline separation on a map guarantees bore and utility do not touch","True utility clearance depends on centerline location, outside dimensions and survey uncertainty; map center distance is not available separation.","Normal mean annular velocity rules out every inadvertent-return risk"],"answer":1,"explanation":"地下設施的中心線位置、外徑和調查精度都影響真正淨距，圖上中心距不是可用安全間隔。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"True utility clearance depends on centerline location, outside dimensions and survey uncertainty; map center distance is not available separation. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":25},{"id":"b174-v14-26","title":"設施淨距與不確定度：定量估算","titleEn":"Utility clearance and uncertainty: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"],"prerequisiteIds":["b174-v14-25"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「設施淨距與不確定度」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Utility clearance and uncertainty” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設：centerDistance=sqrt((0.30 m)^2+(0.40 m)^2)=0.50 m; afterConservativeUncertainty=0.50-0.10-0.15=0.25 m before subtracting radii。導向幾何與磁場算例為小偏差或單段簡化，並非鑽進路徑指令；定位不確定度、管徑及設施尺寸需另併入。 此結果僅用來核對量綱及模型敏感度，不是專案設計值、實測紀錄或現場允收門檻。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions: centerDistance=sqrt((0.30 m)^2+(0.40 m)^2)=0.50 m; afterConservativeUncertainty=0.50-0.10-0.15=0.25 m before subtracting radii. Guidance geometry and magnetic examples simplify small errors or single segments and are not drilling commands; positioning uncertainty, pipe diameter and utility dimensions require separate inclusion. This checks dimensions and model sensitivity; it is neither measured project data nor a design or acceptance value. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：逐一核對設施實測位置、外徑及定位不確定度。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Check surveyed utility position, outside diameter and positioning uncertainty individually.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b174-v14-26-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設：centerDistance=sqrt((0.30 m)^2+(0.40 m)^2)=0.50 m; afterConservativeUncertainty=0.50-0.10-0.15=0.25 m before subtracting radii。導向幾何與磁場算例為小偏差或單段簡化，並非鑽進路徑指令；定位不確定度、管徑及設施尺寸需另併入。 此結果僅用來核對量綱及模型敏感度，不是專案設計值、實測紀錄或現場允收門檻。","textEn":"Original teaching assumptions: centerDistance=sqrt((0.30 m)^2+(0.40 m)^2)=0.50 m; afterConservativeUncertainty=0.50-0.10-0.15=0.25 m before subtracting radii. Guidance geometry and magnetic examples simplify small errors or single segments and are not drilling commands; positioning uncertainty, pipe diameter and utility dimensions require separate inclusion. This checks dimensions and model sensitivity; it is neither measured project data nor a design or acceptance value.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]},{"id":"b174-v14-26-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「設施淨距與不確定度」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Utility clearance and uncertainty\", which statement holds?","options":["終點閉合誤差小就能證明中途所有位置都正確","同一導向儀讀很多次就能消除所有系統性方位偏差","原創教學假設：centerDistance=sqrt((0.30 m)^2+(0.40 m)^2)=0.50 m; afterConservativeUncertainty=0.50-0.10-0.15=0.25 m before subtracting radii。"],"optionsEn":["Small endpoint closure error proves every intermediate position is correct","Many readings from one guidance instrument eliminate every systematic heading bias","Original teaching assumptions: centerDistance=sqrt((0.30 m)^2+(0.40 m)^2)=0.50 m; afterConservativeUncertainty=0.50-0.10-0.15=0.25 m before subtracting radii."],"answer":2,"explanation":"原創教學假設：centerDistance=sqrt((0.30 m)^2+(0.40 m)^2)=0.50 m; afterConservativeUncertainty=0.50-0.10-0.15=0.25 m before subtracting radii。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching assumptions: centerDistance=sqrt((0.30 m)^2+(0.40 m)^2)=0.50 m; afterConservativeUncertainty=0.50-0.10-0.15=0.25 m before subtracting radii. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":26},{"id":"b174-v14-27","title":"設施淨距與不確定度：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Utility clearance and uncertainty: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"],"prerequisiteIds":["b174-v14-26"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「設施淨距與不確定度」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Utility clearance and uncertainty” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"逐一核對設施實測位置、外徑及定位不確定度。量測須保存位置、時間及基準，讓同條件的重複結果可比較；並特別檢查「只比較中心線距離而漏扣半徑，使實際外表面互相侵入」是否能由這組資料區分。儀器校核與誤差估計應先於判讀，由負責技師核定該項試驗的允收和停留點。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Check surveyed utility position, outside diameter and positioning uncertainty individually. Retain position, time and datums for comparable repeats, specifically distinguishing this scenario: Comparing centerlines without radii allows actual external surfaces to intersect. Instrument checks and uncertainty estimates precede interpretation; the responsible engineer sets acceptance and hold points for this test. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：將逐一核對設施實測位置、外徑及定位不確定度列為該構件的交接證據，連結到施工位置、材料批次及判讀版本。若發現只比較中心線距離而漏扣半徑，使實際外表面互相侵入，先保留原始紀錄並由負責技師確認處置，不能以本課算例替代核定作業計畫。","observationEn":"Site practice: Apply the following check at handover: Check surveyed utility position, outside diameter and positioning uncertainty individually. Link results to location, material batch and interpretation version. If comparing centerlines without radii allows actual external surfaces to intersect, retain original records and obtain the responsible engineer's disposition; this example does not replace an approved work plan.","failure":"注意干擾：只比較中心線距離而漏扣半徑，使實際外表面互相侵入。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Comparing centerlines without radii allows actual external surfaces to intersect. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b174-v14-27-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"逐一核對設施實測位置、外徑及定位不確定度。量測須保存位置、時間及基準，讓同條件的重複結果可比較；並特別檢查「只比較中心線距離而漏扣半徑，使實際外表面互相侵入」是否能由這組資料區分。儀器校核與誤差估計應先於判讀，由負責技師核定該項試驗的允收和停留點。","textEn":"Check surveyed utility position, outside diameter and positioning uncertainty individually. Retain position, time and datums for comparable repeats, specifically distinguishing this scenario: Comparing centerlines without radii allows actual external surfaces to intersect. Instrument checks and uncertainty estimates precede interpretation; the responsible engineer sets acceptance and hold points for this test.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]},{"id":"b174-v14-27-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"將逐一核對設施實測位置、外徑及定位不確定度列為該構件的交接證據，連結到施工位置、材料批次及判讀版本。若發現只比較中心線距離而漏扣半徑，使實際外表面互相侵入，先保留原始紀錄並由負責技師確認處置，不能以本課算例替代核定作業計畫。","textEn":"Apply the following check at handover: Check surveyed utility position, outside diameter and positioning uncertainty individually. Link results to location, material batch and interpretation version. If comparing centerlines without radii allows actual external surfaces to intersect, retain original records and obtain the responsible engineer's disposition; this example does not replace an approved work plan.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「設施淨距與不確定度」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Utility clearance and uncertainty\"?","options":["逐一核對設施實測位置、外徑及定位不確定度。","量測時不必記錄溫度、水頭、開挖序列與施工荷重，因為它們不會影響結果。","工具面偏轉角度永遠等於成孔路徑的實際轉向角"],"optionsEn":["Check surveyed utility position, outside diameter and positioning uncertainty individually.","Temperature, water head, excavation sequence and construction loads need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","Toolface deflection always equals the actual turning angle of the bore"],"answer":0,"explanation":"逐一核對設施實測位置、外徑及定位不確定度。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Check surveyed utility position, outside diameter and positioning uncertainty individually. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":27},{"id":"b174-v14-28","title":"設施淨距與不確定度：失效診斷","titleEn":"Utility clearance and uncertainty: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"],"prerequisiteIds":["b174-v14-27"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「設施淨距與不確定度」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Utility clearance and uncertainty” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"只比較中心線距離而漏扣半徑，使實際外表面互相侵入。相似表徵也可能由量測偏差造成，因此應回到逐一核對設施實測位置、外徑及定位不確定度，以獨立證據判別原因；只修補可見症狀將留下原本的傳力或滲流問題。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Comparing centerlines without radii allows actual external surfaces to intersect. Similar symptoms can arise from measurement bias: return to check surveyed utility position, outside diameter and positioning uncertainty individually to discriminate the cause. Treating visible symptoms alone leaves the original transfer or seepage problem unresolved. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：判別這個機制時，應觀察逐一核對設施實測位置、外徑及定位不確定度；若出現只比較中心線距離而漏扣半徑，使實際外表面互相侵入，便須重新檢查原先假設的接觸、力或水的傳遞邊界，而不能只調整計算結果。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: If comparing centerlines without radii allows actual external surfaces to intersect, revisit the assumed contact, force or water-transfer boundary rather than merely adjusting the calculated result.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「圖上的中心距大於零就代表鑽孔與設施一定不接觸」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Positive centerline separation on a map guarantees bore and utility do not touch\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b174-v14-28-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"只比較中心線距離而漏扣半徑，使實際外表面互相侵入。相似表徵也可能由量測偏差造成，因此應回到逐一核對設施實測位置、外徑及定位不確定度，以獨立證據判別原因；只修補可見症狀將留下原本的傳力或滲流問題。","textEn":"Comparing centerlines without radii allows actual external surfaces to intersect. Similar symptoms can arise from measurement bias: return to check surveyed utility position, outside diameter and positioning uncertainty individually to discriminate the cause. Treating visible symptoms alone leaves the original transfer or seepage problem unresolved.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]},{"id":"b174-v14-28-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「設施淨距與不確定度」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Utility clearance and uncertainty\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。","只比較中心線距離而漏扣半徑，使實際外表面互相侵入。","平均環空流速正常就能排除所有冒漿風險"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is a workmanship error, so design and detailing never need review.","Comparing centerlines without radii allows actual external surfaces to intersect.","Normal mean annular velocity rules out every inadvertent-return risk"],"answer":1,"explanation":"只比較中心線距離而漏扣半徑，使實際外表面互相侵入。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Comparing centerlines without radii allows actual external surfaces to intersect. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":28},{"id":"b174-v14-29","title":"環空輸送與孔內壓力：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Annular transport and bore pressure: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"],"prerequisiteIds":["b174-v14-28"],"objective":"說明「環空輸送與孔內壓力」如何影響水平定向鑽掘導向的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Annular transport and bore pressure” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Horizontal directional drilling guidance”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"環空流速由流量和淨流通面積決定，偏心、岩屑床與非牛頓流變會改變局部速度及壓損。平均流速不能單獨證明孔壁穩定或不會冒漿；導向紀錄需與返流及壓力資料共同解釋地層反應。 判別這個機制時，應觀察對照進返流量、環空壓力及地表異常位置；若出現岩屑床縮小流路推高局部壓力，但平均環空面積仍被當固定，便須重新檢查原先假設的接觸、力或水的傳遞邊界，而不能只調整計算結果。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「環空輸送與孔內壓力」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Annular velocity follows flow and available area, while eccentricity, cuttings beds and non-Newtonian rheology change local speed and loss. Mean velocity alone proves neither wall stability nor freedom from inadvertent returns. Interpret guidance with return-flow and pressure evidence to understand ground response. Use the following check to discriminate the mechanism: Compare feed and return flow, annular pressure and locations of surface anomalies. If a cuttings bed restricts flow and raises local pressure while nominal annular area is treated as unchanged, revisit the assumed contact, force or water-transfer boundary rather than merely adjusting the calculated result. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Annular transport and bore pressure” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設：annulusArea=pi*((0.60 m)^2-(0.40 m)^2)/4=0.1571 m2; meanVelocity=0.020 m3/s/0.1571 m2=0.1273 m/s。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions: annulusArea=pi*((0.60 m)^2-(0.40 m)^2)/4=0.1571 m2; meanVelocity=0.020 m3/s/0.1571 m2=0.1273 m/s.","failure":"常見誤解：「平均環空流速正常就能排除所有冒漿風險」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Normal mean annular velocity rules out every inadvertent-return risk\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「環空輸送與孔內壓力」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Annular transport and bore pressure”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b174-v14-29-k1","title":"環空輸送與孔內壓力","titleEn":"Annular transport and bore pressure","text":"環空流速由流量和淨流通面積決定，偏心、岩屑床與非牛頓流變會改變局部速度及壓損。平均流速不能單獨證明孔壁穩定或不會冒漿；導向紀錄需與返流及壓力資料共同解釋地層反應。","textEn":"Annular velocity follows flow and available area, while eccentricity, cuttings beds and non-Newtonian rheology change local speed and loss. Mean velocity alone proves neither wall stability nor freedom from inadvertent returns.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]},{"id":"b174-v14-29-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：平均環空流速正常就能排除所有冒漿風險 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Normal mean annular velocity rules out every inadvertent-return risk Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「環空輸送與孔內壓力」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Annular transport and bore pressure\" is correct?","options":["平均環空流速正常就能排除所有冒漿風險","所有管材都能用同一彈性模量估算回拖應變","環空流速由流量和淨流通面積決定，偏心、岩屑床與非牛頓流變會改變局部速度及壓損。"],"optionsEn":["Normal mean annular velocity rules out every inadvertent-return risk","Every pipe material uses the same elastic modulus for pullback strain","Annular velocity follows flow and available area, while eccentricity, cuttings beds and non-Newtonian rheology change local speed and loss."],"answer":2,"explanation":"環空流速由流量和淨流通面積決定，偏心、岩屑床與非牛頓流變會改變局部速度及壓損。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Annular velocity follows flow and available area, while eccentricity, cuttings beds and non-Newtonian rheology change local speed and loss. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":29},{"id":"b174-v14-30","title":"環空輸送與孔內壓力：定量估算","titleEn":"Annular transport and bore pressure: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"],"prerequisiteIds":["b174-v14-29"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「環空輸送與孔內壓力」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Annular transport and bore pressure” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設：annulusArea=pi*((0.60 m)^2-(0.40 m)^2)/4=0.1571 m2; meanVelocity=0.020 m3/s/0.1571 m2=0.1273 m/s。導向幾何與磁場算例為小偏差或單段簡化，並非鑽進路徑指令；定位不確定度、管徑及設施尺寸需另併入。 此結果僅用來核對量綱及模型敏感度，不是專案設計值、實測紀錄或現場允收門檻。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions: annulusArea=pi*((0.60 m)^2-(0.40 m)^2)/4=0.1571 m2; meanVelocity=0.020 m3/s/0.1571 m2=0.1273 m/s. Guidance geometry and magnetic examples simplify small errors or single segments and are not drilling commands; positioning uncertainty, pipe diameter and utility dimensions require separate inclusion. This checks dimensions and model sensitivity; it is neither measured project data nor a design or acceptance value. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：對照進返流量、環空壓力及地表異常位置。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Compare feed and return flow, annular pressure and locations of surface anomalies.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b174-v14-30-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設：annulusArea=pi*((0.60 m)^2-(0.40 m)^2)/4=0.1571 m2; meanVelocity=0.020 m3/s/0.1571 m2=0.1273 m/s。導向幾何與磁場算例為小偏差或單段簡化，並非鑽進路徑指令；定位不確定度、管徑及設施尺寸需另併入。 此結果僅用來核對量綱及模型敏感度，不是專案設計值、實測紀錄或現場允收門檻。","textEn":"Original teaching assumptions: annulusArea=pi*((0.60 m)^2-(0.40 m)^2)/4=0.1571 m2; meanVelocity=0.020 m3/s/0.1571 m2=0.1273 m/s. Guidance geometry and magnetic examples simplify small errors or single segments and are not drilling commands; positioning uncertainty, pipe diameter and utility dimensions require separate inclusion. This checks dimensions and model sensitivity; it is neither measured project data nor a design or acceptance value.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]},{"id":"b174-v14-30-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「環空輸送與孔內壓力」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Annular transport and bore pressure\", which statement holds?","options":["原創教學假設：annulusArea=pi*((0.60 m)^2-(0.40 m)^2)/4=0.1571 m2; meanVelocity=0.020 m3/s/0.1571 m2=0.1273 m/s。","鑽桿末端傾角一定等於整根鑽桿的平均傾角","用弧長除角度時不需要區分度數與弧度"],"optionsEn":["Original teaching assumptions: annulusArea=pi*((0.60 m)^2-(0.40 m)^2)/4=0.1571 m2; meanVelocity=0.020 m3/s/0.1571 m2=0.1273 m/s.","The rod-end inclination always equals the mean inclination of the whole rod","Dividing arc length by angle never requires distinguishing degrees from radians"],"answer":0,"explanation":"原創教學假設：annulusArea=pi*((0.60 m)^2-(0.40 m)^2)/4=0.1571 m2; meanVelocity=0.020 m3/s/0.1571 m2=0.1273 m/s。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching assumptions: annulusArea=pi*((0.60 m)^2-(0.40 m)^2)/4=0.1571 m2; meanVelocity=0.020 m3/s/0.1571 m2=0.1273 m/s. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":30},{"id":"b174-v14-31","title":"環空輸送與孔內壓力：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Annular transport and bore pressure: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"],"prerequisiteIds":["b174-v14-30"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「環空輸送與孔內壓力」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Annular transport and bore pressure” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"對照進返流量、環空壓力及地表異常位置。量測須保存位置、時間及基準，讓同條件的重複結果可比較；並特別檢查「岩屑床縮小流路推高局部壓力，但平均環空面積仍被當固定」是否能由這組資料區分。儀器校核與誤差估計應先於判讀，由負責技師核定該項試驗的允收和停留點。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Compare feed and return flow, annular pressure and locations of surface anomalies. Retain position, time and datums for comparable repeats, specifically distinguishing this scenario: A cuttings bed restricts flow and raises local pressure while nominal annular area is treated as unchanged. Instrument checks and uncertainty estimates precede interpretation; the responsible engineer sets acceptance and hold points for this test. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：將對照進返流量、環空壓力及地表異常位置列為該構件的交接證據，連結到施工位置、材料批次及判讀版本。若發現岩屑床縮小流路推高局部壓力，但平均環空面積仍被當固定，先保留原始紀錄並由負責技師確認處置，不能以本課算例替代核定作業計畫。","observationEn":"Site practice: Apply the following check at handover: Compare feed and return flow, annular pressure and locations of surface anomalies. Link results to location, material batch and interpretation version. If a cuttings bed restricts flow and raises local pressure while nominal annular area is treated as unchanged, retain original records and obtain the responsible engineer's disposition; this example does not replace an approved work plan.","failure":"注意干擾：岩屑床縮小流路推高局部壓力，但平均環空面積仍被當固定。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: A cuttings bed restricts flow and raises local pressure while nominal annular area is treated as unchanged. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b174-v14-31-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"對照進返流量、環空壓力及地表異常位置。量測須保存位置、時間及基準，讓同條件的重複結果可比較；並特別檢查「岩屑床縮小流路推高局部壓力，但平均環空面積仍被當固定」是否能由這組資料區分。儀器校核與誤差估計應先於判讀，由負責技師核定該項試驗的允收和停留點。","textEn":"Compare feed and return flow, annular pressure and locations of surface anomalies. Retain position, time and datums for comparable repeats, specifically distinguishing this scenario: A cuttings bed restricts flow and raises local pressure while nominal annular area is treated as unchanged. Instrument checks and uncertainty estimates precede interpretation; the responsible engineer sets acceptance and hold points for this test.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]},{"id":"b174-v14-31-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"將對照進返流量、環空壓力及地表異常位置列為該構件的交接證據，連結到施工位置、材料批次及判讀版本。若發現岩屑床縮小流路推高局部壓力，但平均環空面積仍被當固定，先保留原始紀錄並由負責技師確認處置，不能以本課算例替代核定作業計畫。","textEn":"Apply the following check at handover: Compare feed and return flow, annular pressure and locations of surface anomalies. Link results to location, material batch and interpretation version. If a cuttings bed restricts flow and raises local pressure while nominal annular area is treated as unchanged, retain original records and obtain the responsible engineer's disposition; this example does not replace an approved work plan.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「環空輸送與孔內壓力」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Annular transport and bore pressure\"?","options":["沿用另一條隧道或另一處地層的量測結果，就可視為本工程已完成驗證。","對照進返流量、環空壓力及地表異常位置。","總磁場強度正常就能保證磁導向的方位完全準確"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another tunnel or ground formation counts as verifying this structure.","Compare feed and return flow, annular pressure and locations of surface anomalies.","Normal total magnetic intensity guarantees completely accurate magnetic heading"],"answer":1,"explanation":"對照進返流量、環空壓力及地表異常位置。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Compare feed and return flow, annular pressure and locations of surface anomalies. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":31},{"id":"b174-v14-32","title":"環空輸送與孔內壓力：失效診斷","titleEn":"Annular transport and bore pressure: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"],"prerequisiteIds":["b174-v14-31"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「環空輸送與孔內壓力」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Annular transport and bore pressure” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"岩屑床縮小流路推高局部壓力，但平均環空面積仍被當固定。相似表徵也可能由量測偏差造成，因此應回到對照進返流量、環空壓力及地表異常位置，以獨立證據判別原因；只修補可見症狀將留下原本的傳力或滲流問題。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"A cuttings bed restricts flow and raises local pressure while nominal annular area is treated as unchanged. Similar symptoms can arise from measurement bias: return to compare feed and return flow, annular pressure and locations of surface anomalies to discriminate the cause. Treating visible symptoms alone leaves the original transfer or seepage problem unresolved. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：判別這個機制時，應觀察對照進返流量、環空壓力及地表異常位置；若出現岩屑床縮小流路推高局部壓力，但平均環空面積仍被當固定，便須重新檢查原先假設的接觸、力或水的傳遞邊界，而不能只調整計算結果。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: If a cuttings bed restricts flow and raises local pressure while nominal annular area is treated as unchanged, revisit the assumed contact, force or water-transfer boundary rather than merely adjusting the calculated result.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「平均環空流速正常就能排除所有冒漿風險」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Normal mean annular velocity rules out every inadvertent-return risk\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b174-v14-32-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"岩屑床縮小流路推高局部壓力，但平均環空面積仍被當固定。相似表徵也可能由量測偏差造成，因此應回到對照進返流量、環空壓力及地表異常位置，以獨立證據判別原因；只修補可見症狀將留下原本的傳力或滲流問題。","textEn":"A cuttings bed restricts flow and raises local pressure while nominal annular area is treated as unchanged. Similar symptoms can arise from measurement bias: return to compare feed and return flow, annular pressure and locations of surface anomalies to discriminate the cause. Treating visible symptoms alone leaves the original transfer or seepage problem unresolved.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]},{"id":"b174-v14-32-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「環空輸送與孔內壓力」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Annular transport and bore pressure\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。","所有管材都能用同一彈性模量估算回拖應變","岩屑床縮小流路推高局部壓力，但平均環空面積仍被當固定。"],"optionsEn":["Adding a coat of paint or widening the acceptance limits solves most deterioration problems.","Every pipe material uses the same elastic modulus for pullback strain","A cuttings bed restricts flow and raises local pressure while nominal annular area is treated as unchanged."],"answer":2,"explanation":"岩屑床縮小流路推高局部壓力，但平均環空面積仍被當固定。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A cuttings bed restricts flow and raises local pressure while nominal annular area is treated as unchanged. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":32}],"order":4},{"id":"b174-v14-s5","title":"耐久、維護與工程交接","titleEn":"Durability, maintenance and engineering handoff","description":"本階段聚焦「回拖彎曲與軸向應變」與「竣工閉合與全線可信度」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Pullback bending and axial strain\" and \"As-built closure and route confidence\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b174-v14-33","title":"回拖彎曲與軸向應變：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Pullback bending and axial strain: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"],"prerequisiteIds":["b174-v14-32"],"objective":"說明「回拖彎曲與軸向應變」如何影響水平定向鑽掘導向的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Pullback bending and axial strain” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Horizontal directional drilling guidance”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"成品管沿孔道曲率彎曲，回拖張力再疊加軸向應變，最外纖維可能成為控制位置。小應變線彈性相加需使用一致材料模量，熱塑管的時間與溫度行為不能直接套鋼材；實際孔徑和摩擦仍影響回拖荷載。 判別這個機制時，應觀察比較成孔曲率、回拖荷重及成品管材溫度性能；若出現鋼管模量被錯用於塑膠管，嚴重低估實際軸向變形，便須重新檢查原先假設的接觸、力或水的傳遞邊界，而不能只調整計算結果。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「回拖彎曲與軸向應變」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The product pipe bends along bore curvature while pullback tension adds axial strain, potentially governing the outer fiber. Small-strain elastic addition requires consistent modulus; thermoplastic time and temperature behavior cannot be replaced by steel assumptions. Actual bore geometry and friction also affect pullback loading. Use the following check to discriminate the mechanism: Compare bore curvature, pullback load and temperature-dependent product-pipe properties. If applying steel modulus to plastic pipe substantially understates actual axial deformation, revisit the assumed contact, force or water-transfer boundary rather than merely adjusting the calculated result. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Pullback bending and axial strain” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設：elasticSteelExample: bendingStrain=D/(2*R)=0.40 m/(2*200 m)=0.001; axialStrain=20 MPa/200000 MPa=0.0001; sum=0.0011。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions: elasticSteelExample: bendingStrain=D/(2*R)=0.40 m/(2*200 m)=0.001; axialStrain=20 MPa/200000 MPa=0.0001; sum=0.0011.","failure":"常見誤解：「所有管材都能用同一彈性模量估算回拖應變」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Every pipe material uses the same elastic modulus for pullback strain\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「回拖彎曲與軸向應變」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Pullback bending and axial strain”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b174-v14-33-k1","title":"回拖彎曲與軸向應變","titleEn":"Pullback bending and axial strain","text":"成品管沿孔道曲率彎曲，回拖張力再疊加軸向應變，最外纖維可能成為控制位置。小應變線彈性相加需使用一致材料模量，熱塑管的時間與溫度行為不能直接套鋼材；實際孔徑和摩擦仍影響回拖荷載。","textEn":"The product pipe bends along bore curvature while pullback tension adds axial strain, potentially governing the outer fiber. Small-strain elastic addition requires consistent modulus; thermoplastic time and temperature behavior cannot be replaced by steel assumptions.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]},{"id":"b174-v14-33-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：所有管材都能用同一彈性模量估算回拖應變 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Every pipe material uses the same elastic modulus for pullback strain Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「回拖彎曲與軸向應變」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Pullback bending and axial strain\" is correct?","options":["成品管沿孔道曲率彎曲，回拖張力再疊加軸向應變，最外纖維可能成為控制位置。","所有管材都能用同一彈性模量估算回拖應變","終點閉合誤差小就能證明中途所有位置都正確"],"optionsEn":["The product pipe bends along bore curvature while pullback tension adds axial strain, potentially governing the outer fiber.","Every pipe material uses the same elastic modulus for pullback strain","Small endpoint closure error proves every intermediate position is correct"],"answer":0,"explanation":"成品管沿孔道曲率彎曲，回拖張力再疊加軸向應變，最外纖維可能成為控制位置。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The product pipe bends along bore curvature while pullback tension adds axial strain, potentially governing the outer fiber. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":33},{"id":"b174-v14-34","title":"回拖彎曲與軸向應變：定量估算","titleEn":"Pullback bending and axial strain: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"],"prerequisiteIds":["b174-v14-33"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「回拖彎曲與軸向應變」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Pullback bending and axial strain” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設：elasticSteelExample: bendingStrain=D/(2*R)=0.40 m/(2*200 m)=0.001; axialStrain=20 MPa/200000 MPa=0.0001; sum=0.0011。導向幾何與磁場算例為小偏差或單段簡化，並非鑽進路徑指令；定位不確定度、管徑及設施尺寸需另併入。 此結果僅用來核對量綱及模型敏感度，不是專案設計值、實測紀錄或現場允收門檻。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions: elasticSteelExample: bendingStrain=D/(2*R)=0.40 m/(2*200 m)=0.001; axialStrain=20 MPa/200000 MPa=0.0001; sum=0.0011. Guidance geometry and magnetic examples simplify small errors or single segments and are not drilling commands; positioning uncertainty, pipe diameter and utility dimensions require separate inclusion. This checks dimensions and model sensitivity; it is neither measured project data nor a design or acceptance value. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：比較成孔曲率、回拖荷重及成品管材溫度性能。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Compare bore curvature, pullback load and temperature-dependent product-pipe properties.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b174-v14-34-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設：elasticSteelExample: bendingStrain=D/(2*R)=0.40 m/(2*200 m)=0.001; axialStrain=20 MPa/200000 MPa=0.0001; sum=0.0011。導向幾何與磁場算例為小偏差或單段簡化，並非鑽進路徑指令；定位不確定度、管徑及設施尺寸需另併入。 此結果僅用來核對量綱及模型敏感度，不是專案設計值、實測紀錄或現場允收門檻。","textEn":"Original teaching assumptions: elasticSteelExample: bendingStrain=D/(2*R)=0.40 m/(2*200 m)=0.001; axialStrain=20 MPa/200000 MPa=0.0001; sum=0.0011. Guidance geometry and magnetic examples simplify small errors or single segments and are not drilling commands; positioning uncertainty, pipe diameter and utility dimensions require separate inclusion. This checks dimensions and model sensitivity; it is neither measured project data nor a design or acceptance value.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]},{"id":"b174-v14-34-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「回拖彎曲與軸向應變」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Pullback bending and axial strain\", which statement holds?","options":["同一導向儀讀很多次就能消除所有系統性方位偏差","原創教學假設：elasticSteelExample: bendingStrain=D/(2*R)=0.40 m/(2*200 m)=0.001; axialStrain=20 MPa/200000 MPa=0.0001; sum=0.0011。","工具面偏轉角度永遠等於成孔路徑的實際轉向角"],"optionsEn":["Many readings from one guidance instrument eliminate every systematic heading bias","Original teaching assumptions: elasticSteelExample: bendingStrain=D/(2*R)=0.40 m/(2*200 m)=0.001; axialStrain=20 MPa/200000 MPa=0.0001; sum=0.0011.","Toolface deflection always equals the actual turning angle of the bore"],"answer":1,"explanation":"原創教學假設：elasticSteelExample: bendingStrain=D/(2*R)=0.40 m/(2*200 m)=0.001; axialStrain=20 MPa/200000 MPa=0.0001; sum=0.0011。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching assumptions: elasticSteelExample: bendingStrain=D/(2*R)=0.40 m/(2*200 m)=0.001; axialStrain=20 MPa/200000 MPa=0.0001; sum=0.0011. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":34},{"id":"b174-v14-35","title":"回拖彎曲與軸向應變：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Pullback bending and axial strain: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"],"prerequisiteIds":["b174-v14-34"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「回拖彎曲與軸向應變」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Pullback bending and axial strain” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"比較成孔曲率、回拖荷重及成品管材溫度性能。量測須保存位置、時間及基準，讓同條件的重複結果可比較；並特別檢查「鋼管模量被錯用於塑膠管，嚴重低估實際軸向變形」是否能由這組資料區分。儀器校核與誤差估計應先於判讀，由負責技師核定該項試驗的允收和停留點。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Compare bore curvature, pullback load and temperature-dependent product-pipe properties. Retain position, time and datums for comparable repeats, specifically distinguishing this scenario: Applying steel modulus to plastic pipe substantially understates actual axial deformation. Instrument checks and uncertainty estimates precede interpretation; the responsible engineer sets acceptance and hold points for this test. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：將比較成孔曲率、回拖荷重及成品管材溫度性能列為該構件的交接證據，連結到施工位置、材料批次及判讀版本。若發現鋼管模量被錯用於塑膠管，嚴重低估實際軸向變形，先保留原始紀錄並由負責技師確認處置，不能以本課算例替代核定作業計畫。","observationEn":"Site practice: Apply the following check at handover: Compare bore curvature, pullback load and temperature-dependent product-pipe properties. Link results to location, material batch and interpretation version. If applying steel modulus to plastic pipe substantially understates actual axial deformation, retain original records and obtain the responsible engineer's disposition; this example does not replace an approved work plan.","failure":"注意干擾：鋼管模量被錯用於塑膠管，嚴重低估實際軸向變形。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Applying steel modulus to plastic pipe substantially understates actual axial deformation. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b174-v14-35-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"比較成孔曲率、回拖荷重及成品管材溫度性能。量測須保存位置、時間及基準，讓同條件的重複結果可比較；並特別檢查「鋼管模量被錯用於塑膠管，嚴重低估實際軸向變形」是否能由這組資料區分。儀器校核與誤差估計應先於判讀，由負責技師核定該項試驗的允收和停留點。","textEn":"Compare bore curvature, pullback load and temperature-dependent product-pipe properties. Retain position, time and datums for comparable repeats, specifically distinguishing this scenario: Applying steel modulus to plastic pipe substantially understates actual axial deformation. Instrument checks and uncertainty estimates precede interpretation; the responsible engineer sets acceptance and hold points for this test.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]},{"id":"b174-v14-35-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"將比較成孔曲率、回拖荷重及成品管材溫度性能列為該構件的交接證據，連結到施工位置、材料批次及判讀版本。若發現鋼管模量被錯用於塑膠管，嚴重低估實際軸向變形，先保留原始紀錄並由負責技師確認處置，不能以本課算例替代核定作業計畫。","textEn":"Apply the following check at handover: Compare bore curvature, pullback load and temperature-dependent product-pipe properties. Link results to location, material batch and interpretation version. If applying steel modulus to plastic pipe substantially understates actual axial deformation, retain original records and obtain the responsible engineer's disposition; this example does not replace an approved work plan.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「回拖彎曲與軸向應變」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Pullback bending and axial strain\"?","options":["只看一次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準點、參考試體或重複量測。","陀螺不受磁場影響就代表永遠不會產生方位誤差","比較成孔曲率、回拖荷重及成品管材溫度性能。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the work; no datum, reference specimen or repeat measurement is needed.","A gyro immune to magnetic interference never develops heading error","Compare bore curvature, pullback load and temperature-dependent product-pipe properties."],"answer":2,"explanation":"比較成孔曲率、回拖荷重及成品管材溫度性能。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Compare bore curvature, pullback load and temperature-dependent product-pipe properties. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":35},{"id":"b174-v14-36","title":"回拖彎曲與軸向應變：失效診斷","titleEn":"Pullback bending and axial strain: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"],"prerequisiteIds":["b174-v14-35"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「回拖彎曲與軸向應變」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Pullback bending and axial strain” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"鋼管模量被錯用於塑膠管，嚴重低估實際軸向變形。相似表徵也可能由量測偏差造成，因此應回到比較成孔曲率、回拖荷重及成品管材溫度性能，以獨立證據判別原因；只修補可見症狀將留下原本的傳力或滲流問題。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Applying steel modulus to plastic pipe substantially understates actual axial deformation. Similar symptoms can arise from measurement bias: return to compare bore curvature, pullback load and temperature-dependent product-pipe properties to discriminate the cause. Treating visible symptoms alone leaves the original transfer or seepage problem unresolved. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：判別這個機制時，應觀察比較成孔曲率、回拖荷重及成品管材溫度性能；若出現鋼管模量被錯用於塑膠管，嚴重低估實際軸向變形，便須重新檢查原先假設的接觸、力或水的傳遞邊界，而不能只調整計算結果。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: If applying steel modulus to plastic pipe substantially understates actual axial deformation, revisit the assumed contact, force or water-transfer boundary rather than merely adjusting the calculated result.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「所有管材都能用同一彈性模量估算回拖應變」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Every pipe material uses the same elastic modulus for pullback strain\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b174-v14-36-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"鋼管模量被錯用於塑膠管，嚴重低估實際軸向變形。相似表徵也可能由量測偏差造成，因此應回到比較成孔曲率、回拖荷重及成品管材溫度性能，以獨立證據判別原因；只修補可見症狀將留下原本的傳力或滲流問題。","textEn":"Applying steel modulus to plastic pipe substantially understates actual axial deformation. Similar symptoms can arise from measurement bias: return to compare bore curvature, pullback load and temperature-dependent product-pipe properties to discriminate the cause. Treating visible symptoms alone leaves the original transfer or seepage problem unresolved.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]},{"id":"b174-v14-36-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「回拖彎曲與軸向應變」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Pullback bending and axial strain\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["鋼管模量被錯用於塑膠管，嚴重低估實際軸向變形。","裂縫或異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","終點閉合誤差小就能證明中途所有位置都正確"],"optionsEn":["Applying steel modulus to plastic pipe substantially understates actual axial deformation.","A crack or anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","Small endpoint closure error proves every intermediate position is correct"],"answer":0,"explanation":"鋼管模量被錯用於塑膠管，嚴重低估實際軸向變形。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Applying steel modulus to plastic pipe substantially understates actual axial deformation. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":36},{"id":"b174-v14-37","title":"竣工閉合與全線可信度：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"As-built closure and route confidence: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"],"prerequisiteIds":["b174-v14-36"],"objective":"說明「竣工閉合與全線可信度」如何影響水平定向鑽掘導向的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “As-built closure and route confidence” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Horizontal directional drilling guidance”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"終點閉合誤差是整段測量的一項約束，不能保證中途每個位置正確；相反方向偏差可能在終點互相抵消。全線成果需保留逐桿原始資料、校正和獨立控制，並把位置不確定度沿路徑呈現。 判別這個機制時，應觀察把終點閉合與中途獨立控制點及逐桿資料比對；若出現中途左右偏差相互抵消，終點漂亮卻曾侵入設施走廊，便須重新檢查原先假設的接觸、力或水的傳遞邊界，而不能只調整計算結果。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「竣工閉合與全線可信度」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Endpoint closure constrains the survey but does not prove every intermediate position, because opposing errors can cancel at the end. Preserve raw rod-by-rod data, corrections and independent control. Present uncertainty along the route rather than interpreting one endpoint residual as a universal error bound. Use the following check to discriminate the mechanism: Compare endpoint closure with intermediate independent control points and rod-by-rod data. If opposing intermediate errors cancel at the endpoint despite entering a utility corridor along the route, revisit the assumed contact, force or water-transfer boundary rather than merely adjusting the calculated result. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “As-built closure and route confidence” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設：endpointResidual=sqrt((0.05 m)^2+(0.03 m)^2+(0.04 m)^2)=0.0707 m。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions: endpointResidual=sqrt((0.05 m)^2+(0.03 m)^2+(0.04 m)^2)=0.0707 m.","failure":"常見誤解：「終點閉合誤差小就能證明中途所有位置都正確」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Small endpoint closure error proves every intermediate position is correct\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「竣工閉合與全線可信度」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “As-built closure and route confidence”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b174-v14-37-k1","title":"竣工閉合與全線可信度","titleEn":"As-built closure and route confidence","text":"終點閉合誤差是整段測量的一項約束，不能保證中途每個位置正確；相反方向偏差可能在終點互相抵消。全線成果需保留逐桿原始資料、校正和獨立控制，並把位置不確定度沿路徑呈現。","textEn":"Endpoint closure constrains the survey but does not prove every intermediate position, because opposing errors can cancel at the end. Preserve raw rod-by-rod data, corrections and independent control.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]},{"id":"b174-v14-37-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：終點閉合誤差小就能證明中途所有位置都正確 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Small endpoint closure error proves every intermediate position is correct Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「竣工閉合與全線可信度」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"As-built closure and route confidence\" is correct?","options":["終點閉合誤差小就能證明中途所有位置都正確","終點閉合誤差是整段測量的一項約束，不能保證中途每個位置正確；相反方向偏差可能在終點互相抵消。","鑽桿末端傾角一定等於整根鑽桿的平均傾角"],"optionsEn":["Small endpoint closure error proves every intermediate position is correct","Endpoint closure constrains the survey but does not prove every intermediate position, because opposing errors can cancel at the end.","The rod-end inclination always equals the mean inclination of the whole rod"],"answer":1,"explanation":"終點閉合誤差是整段測量的一項約束，不能保證中途每個位置正確；相反方向偏差可能在終點互相抵消。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Endpoint closure constrains the survey but does not prove every intermediate position, because opposing errors can cancel at the end. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":37},{"id":"b174-v14-38","title":"竣工閉合與全線可信度：定量估算","titleEn":"As-built closure and route confidence: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"],"prerequisiteIds":["b174-v14-37"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「竣工閉合與全線可信度」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “As-built closure and route confidence” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設：endpointResidual=sqrt((0.05 m)^2+(0.03 m)^2+(0.04 m)^2)=0.0707 m。導向幾何與磁場算例為小偏差或單段簡化，並非鑽進路徑指令；定位不確定度、管徑及設施尺寸需另併入。 此結果僅用來核對量綱及模型敏感度，不是專案設計值、實測紀錄或現場允收門檻。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions: endpointResidual=sqrt((0.05 m)^2+(0.03 m)^2+(0.04 m)^2)=0.0707 m. Guidance geometry and magnetic examples simplify small errors or single segments and are not drilling commands; positioning uncertainty, pipe diameter and utility dimensions require separate inclusion. This checks dimensions and model sensitivity; it is neither measured project data nor a design or acceptance value. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：把終點閉合與中途獨立控制點及逐桿資料比對。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Compare endpoint closure with intermediate independent control points and rod-by-rod data.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b174-v14-38-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設：endpointResidual=sqrt((0.05 m)^2+(0.03 m)^2+(0.04 m)^2)=0.0707 m。導向幾何與磁場算例為小偏差或單段簡化，並非鑽進路徑指令；定位不確定度、管徑及設施尺寸需另併入。 此結果僅用來核對量綱及模型敏感度，不是專案設計值、實測紀錄或現場允收門檻。","textEn":"Original teaching assumptions: endpointResidual=sqrt((0.05 m)^2+(0.03 m)^2+(0.04 m)^2)=0.0707 m. Guidance geometry and magnetic examples simplify small errors or single segments and are not drilling commands; positioning uncertainty, pipe diameter and utility dimensions require separate inclusion. This checks dimensions and model sensitivity; it is neither measured project data nor a design or acceptance value.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]},{"id":"b174-v14-38-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「竣工閉合與全線可信度」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"As-built closure and route confidence\", which statement holds?","options":["用弧長除角度時不需要區分度數與弧度","總磁場強度正常就能保證磁導向的方位完全準確","原創教學假設：endpointResidual=sqrt((0.05 m)^2+(0.03 m)^2+(0.04 m)^2)=0.0707 m。"],"optionsEn":["Dividing arc length by angle never requires distinguishing degrees from radians","Normal total magnetic intensity guarantees completely accurate magnetic heading","Original teaching assumptions: endpointResidual=sqrt((0.05 m)^2+(0.03 m)^2+(0.04 m)^2)=0.0707 m."],"answer":2,"explanation":"原創教學假設：endpointResidual=sqrt((0.05 m)^2+(0.03 m)^2+(0.04 m)^2)=0.0707 m。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching assumptions: endpointResidual=sqrt((0.05 m)^2+(0.03 m)^2+(0.04 m)^2)=0.0707 m. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":38},{"id":"b174-v14-39","title":"竣工閉合與全線可信度：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"As-built closure and route confidence: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"],"prerequisiteIds":["b174-v14-38"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「竣工閉合與全線可信度」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “As-built closure and route confidence” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"把終點閉合與中途獨立控制點及逐桿資料比對。量測須保存位置、時間及基準，讓同條件的重複結果可比較；並特別檢查「中途左右偏差相互抵消，終點漂亮卻曾侵入設施走廊」是否能由這組資料區分。儀器校核與誤差估計應先於判讀，由負責技師核定該項試驗的允收和停留點。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Compare endpoint closure with intermediate independent control points and rod-by-rod data. Retain position, time and datums for comparable repeats, specifically distinguishing this scenario: Opposing intermediate errors cancel at the endpoint despite entering a utility corridor along the route. Instrument checks and uncertainty estimates precede interpretation; the responsible engineer sets acceptance and hold points for this test. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：將把終點閉合與中途獨立控制點及逐桿資料比對列為該構件的交接證據，連結到施工位置、材料批次及判讀版本。若發現中途左右偏差相互抵消，終點漂亮卻曾侵入設施走廊，先保留原始紀錄並由負責技師確認處置，不能以本課算例替代核定作業計畫。","observationEn":"Site practice: Apply the following check at handover: Compare endpoint closure with intermediate independent control points and rod-by-rod data. Link results to location, material batch and interpretation version. If opposing intermediate errors cancel at the endpoint despite entering a utility corridor along the route, retain original records and obtain the responsible engineer's disposition; this example does not replace an approved work plan.","failure":"注意干擾：中途左右偏差相互抵消，終點漂亮卻曾侵入設施走廊。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Opposing intermediate errors cancel at the endpoint despite entering a utility corridor along the route. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b174-v14-39-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"把終點閉合與中途獨立控制點及逐桿資料比對。量測須保存位置、時間及基準，讓同條件的重複結果可比較；並特別檢查「中途左右偏差相互抵消，終點漂亮卻曾侵入設施走廊」是否能由這組資料區分。儀器校核與誤差估計應先於判讀，由負責技師核定該項試驗的允收和停留點。","textEn":"Compare endpoint closure with intermediate independent control points and rod-by-rod data. Retain position, time and datums for comparable repeats, specifically distinguishing this scenario: Opposing intermediate errors cancel at the endpoint despite entering a utility corridor along the route. Instrument checks and uncertainty estimates precede interpretation; the responsible engineer sets acceptance and hold points for this test.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]},{"id":"b174-v14-39-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"將把終點閉合與中途獨立控制點及逐桿資料比對列為該構件的交接證據，連結到施工位置、材料批次及判讀版本。若發現中途左右偏差相互抵消，終點漂亮卻曾侵入設施走廊，先保留原始紀錄並由負責技師確認處置，不能以本課算例替代核定作業計畫。","textEn":"Apply the following check at handover: Compare endpoint closure with intermediate independent control points and rod-by-rod data. Link results to location, material batch and interpretation version. If opposing intermediate errors cancel at the endpoint despite entering a utility corridor along the route, retain original records and obtain the responsible engineer's disposition; this example does not replace an approved work plan.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「竣工閉合與全線可信度」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"As-built closure and route confidence\"?","options":["把終點閉合與中途獨立控制點及逐桿資料比對。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","圖上的中心距大於零就代表鑽孔與設施一定不接觸"],"optionsEn":["Compare endpoint closure with intermediate independent control points and rod-by-rod data.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","Positive centerline separation on a map guarantees bore and utility do not touch"],"answer":0,"explanation":"把終點閉合與中途獨立控制點及逐桿資料比對。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Compare endpoint closure with intermediate independent control points and rod-by-rod data. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":39},{"id":"b174-v14-40","title":"竣工閉合與全線可信度：失效診斷","titleEn":"As-built closure and route confidence: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"],"prerequisiteIds":["b174-v14-39"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「竣工閉合與全線可信度」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “As-built closure and route confidence” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"中途左右偏差相互抵消，終點漂亮卻曾侵入設施走廊。相似表徵也可能由量測偏差造成，因此應回到把終點閉合與中途獨立控制點及逐桿資料比對，以獨立證據判別原因；只修補可見症狀將留下原本的傳力或滲流問題。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Opposing intermediate errors cancel at the endpoint despite entering a utility corridor along the route. Similar symptoms can arise from measurement bias: return to compare endpoint closure with intermediate independent control points and rod-by-rod data to discriminate the cause. Treating visible symptoms alone leaves the original transfer or seepage problem unresolved. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：判別這個機制時，應觀察把終點閉合與中途獨立控制點及逐桿資料比對；若出現中途左右偏差相互抵消，終點漂亮卻曾侵入設施走廊，便須重新檢查原先假設的接觸、力或水的傳遞邊界，而不能只調整計算結果。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: If opposing intermediate errors cancel at the endpoint despite entering a utility corridor along the route, revisit the assumed contact, force or water-transfer boundary rather than merely adjusting the calculated result.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「終點閉合誤差小就能證明中途所有位置都正確」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Small endpoint closure error proves every intermediate position is correct\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b174-v14-40-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"中途左右偏差相互抵消，終點漂亮卻曾侵入設施走廊。相似表徵也可能由量測偏差造成，因此應回到把終點閉合與中途獨立控制點及逐桿資料比對，以獨立證據判別原因；只修補可見症狀將留下原本的傳力或滲流問題。","textEn":"Opposing intermediate errors cancel at the endpoint despite entering a utility corridor along the route. Similar symptoms can arise from measurement bias: return to compare endpoint closure with intermediate independent control points and rod-by-rod data to discriminate the cause. Treating visible symptoms alone leaves the original transfer or seepage problem unresolved.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]},{"id":"b174-v14-40-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「竣工閉合與全線可信度」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"As-built closure and route confidence\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","中途左右偏差相互抵消，終點漂亮卻曾侵入設施走廊。","鑽桿末端傾角一定等於整根鑽桿的平均傾角"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive component first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","Opposing intermediate errors cancel at the endpoint despite entering a utility corridor along the route.","The rod-end inclination always equals the mean inclination of the whole rod"],"answer":1,"explanation":"中途左右偏差相互抵消，終點漂亮卻曾侵入設施走廊。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Opposing intermediate errors cancel at the endpoint despite entering a utility corridor along the route. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":40}],"order":5}],"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-trenchless"],"curriculumVersion":14,"stepCount":40,"estimatedMinutes":1000}};
